bu sozlama qidiruv tizimi botlari ro\'yxatini qayta tiklaydi va o\'chirilganlar ro\'yxatini tozalaydi!','This site utilizes caching in order to facilitate a faster response time and better user experience. Caching potentially stores a duplicate copy of every web page that is on display on this site. All cache files are temporary, and are never accessed by any third party, except as necessary to obtain technical support from the cache plugin vendor. Cache files expire on a schedule set by the site administrator, but may easily be purged by the admin before their natural expiration, if necessary. We may use QUIC.cloud services to process & cache your data temporarily.'=>'Bu sayt tezroq javob berish vaqtini va yaxshiroq foydalanuvchi tajribasini taʼminlash uchun keshdan foydalanadi. Kesh potensial ravishda ushbu saytda koʻrsatiladigan har bir veb-sahifaning dublikat nusxasini saqlaydi. Barcha kesh fayllari vaqtinchalik boʻlib, kesh plagini yetkazib beruvchisidan texnik yordam olish uchun zarur boʻlgan holatlar bundan mustasno, hech qanday uchinchi tomon tomonidan ularga kirilmaydi. Kesh fayllari sayt administratori belgilagan jadvalga muvofiq muddati tugaydi, ammo kerak boʻlsa, tabiiy muddati tugashidan oldin administrator tomonidan osongina tozalanishi mumkin. Maʼlumotlaringizni vaqtincha qayta ishlash va kesh qilish uchun QUIC.cloud xizmatlaridan foydalanishimiz mumkin.','Please see %s for more details.'=>'Qo\'shimcha ma\'lumot olish uchun %s sahifasiga qarang.','Learn More'=>'Batafsil ma\'lumot','Both full and partial strings can be used.'=>'To\'liq va qisman satrlarning ikkalasidan ham foydalanish mumkin.','Both full URLs and partial strings can be used.'=>'To\'liq URL manzillari ham, qisman satrlar ham ishlatilishi mumkin.','This setting will edit the .htaccess file.'=>'Ushbu sozlama .htaccess faylini tahrirlaydi.','The queue is processed asynchronously. It may take time.'=>'Navbat asinxron tarzda qayta ishlanadi. Bu vaqt olishi mumkin.','This feature needs an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin. The setting has no effect.'=>'Bu funksiya ushbu plginga kiritilmagan onlayn generatsiya xizmatini talab qiladi. Sozlamaning hech qanday ta\'siri yo\'q.','You have used all of your daily quota for today.'=>'Siz bugungi kundalik kvotangizdan to\'liq foydalandingiz.','Learn more or purchase additional quota.'=>'Ko\'proq ma\'lumot oling yoki qo\'shimcha kvota sotib oling.','You have used all of your quota left for current service this month.'=>'Siz joriy oy uchun joriy xizmatingizning barcha kvotasidan foydalandingiz.','You have too many requested images, please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Siz juda ko\'p tasvirlarni so\'radingiz, iltimos, bir necha daqiqadan so\'ng yana urinib ko\'ring.','You have images waiting to be pulled. Please wait for the automatic pull to complete, or pull them down manually now.'=>'Yuklab olinishini kutayotgan rasmlaringiz bor. Iltimos, avtomatik yuklab olish tugashini kuting yoki ularni hozir qo‘lda yuklab oling.','The image list is empty.'=>'Rasmlar roʻyxati boʻsh.','Not enough parameters. Please check if the QUIC.cloud connection is set correctly'=>'Parametrlar yetarli emas. Iltimos, QUIC.cloud ulanishi to‘g‘ri sozlanganligini tekshiring','There is proceeding queue not pulled yet.'=>'Hali olinmagan jarayon navbati mavjud.','There is proceeding queue not pulled yet. Queue info: %s.'=>'Hali tortib olinmagan jarayonlar navbati mavjud. Navbat haqida ma\'lumot: %s.','The site is not a valid alias on QUIC.cloud.'=>'Sayt QUIC.cloud\'da yaroqli alias emas.','The site is not registered on QUIC.cloud.'=>'Sayt QUIC.cloud\'da roʻyxatdan oʻtmagan.','The QUIC.cloud connection is not correct. Please try to sync your QUIC.cloud connection again.'=>'QUIC.cloud ulanishi noto‘g‘ri. Iltimos, QUIC.cloud ulanishingizni qaytadan sinxronlashga harakat qiling.','The current server is under heavy load.'=>'Joriy server og\'ir yuk ostida.','Online node needs to be redetected.'=>'Onlayn tugunni qayta aniql