sh uchun LiteSpeed Web Server xabardor qilindi.','OPcache is not enabled.'=>'OPcache yoqilmagan.','OPcache is restricted by %s setting.'=>'OPcache %s sozlamasi bilan cheklangan.','Reset the OPcache failed.'=>'OPcache-ni tiklab bo‘lmadi.','Reset the entire OPcache successfully.'=>'Barcha OPcache muvaffaqiyatli qayta o\'rnatildi.','Object cache is not enabled.'=>'Ob\'ekt kesh yoqilmagan.','Purge all object caches successfully.'=>'Barcha obyekt keshlarini muvaffaqiyatli tozalang.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge the front page.'=>'Bosh sahifani tozalash uchun LiteSpeed Web Server xabardor qilindi.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge all pages.'=>'Barcha sahifalarni tozalash uchun LiteSpeed Web Server xabardor qilindi.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge error pages.'=>'Xatolik sahifalarini tozalash uchun LiteSpeed Web Server xabardor qilindi.','Purge category %s'=>'%s kategoriyasini tozalash','Purge tag %s'=>'%s tegini tozalash','Purge url %s'=>'URL %s ni tozalash','All QUIC.cloud service queues have been cleared.'=>'Barcha QUIC.cloud xizmat navbatlari tozalandi.','Every 15 Minutes'=>'Har 15 daqiqada','LiteSpeed Crawler Cron'=>'LiteSpeed Crawler Cron','Failed to detect IP'=>'IP aniqlanmadi','right now'=>'hozir','just now'=>'hozirgina',' %s ago'=>'%s oldin','Please consider disabling the following detected plugins, as they may conflict with Zinn® Cache Engine:'=>'Aniqlangan quyidagi plaginlarni o\'chirib qo\'yishni o\'ylab ko\'ring, chunki ular Zinn® Cache Engine bilan ziddiyatga kelishi mumkin:','WooCommerce Settings'=>'WooCommerce sozlamalari','NOTICE:'=>'DIQQAT:','After verifying that the cache works in general, please test the cart.'=>'Kesh umumiy tarzda ishlashini tekshirgandan so\'ng, iltimos, savatni sinab ko\'ring.','To test the cart, visit the %sFAQ%s.'=>'Savatni sinab ko\'rish uchun %sFAQ%s sahifasiga tashrif buyuring.','By default, the My Account, Checkout, and Cart pages are automatically excluded from caching. Misconfiguration of page associations in WooCommerce settings may cause some pages to be erroneously excluded.'=>'Standart holatda «Mening hisobim», «Buyurtma berish» va «Savat» sahifalari keshlanishdan avtomatik ravishda istisno qilinadi. WooCommerce sozlamalarida sahifalarni bog\'lashdagi xatoliklar ba\'zi sahifalarning xatoshlar bilan istisno qilinishiga olib kelishi mumkin.','Product Update Interval'=>'Mahsulotni yangilash oralig\'i','Purge product on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Miqdor yoki ombor holati o‘zgarganda mahsulotni tozalang.','Purge categories only when stock status changes.'=>'Faqat ombor holati o\'zgarganda toifalarni tozalang.','Purge product and categories only when the stock status changes.'=>'Faqat ombor holati o\'zgarganda mahsulot va toifalarni tozalang.','Purge product only when the stock status changes.'=>'Faqat tovarni tozalash holati o\'zgarganda.','Do not purge categories on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Miqdor yoki ombor holati o‘zgarganda toifalarni tozalab tashlamang.','Always purge both product and categories on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Miqdor yoki ombor holati o\'zgarganda har doim ham mahsulotni, ham toifalarni tozalang.','Determines how changes in product quantity and product stock status affect product pages and their associated category pages.'=>'Mahsulot miqdori va mahsulot zaxirasi holatidagi o\'zgarishlar mahsulot sahifalariga hamda ularga tegishli turkum sahifalariga qanday ta\'sir qilishini belgilaydi.','Vary for Mini Cart'=>'Mini savat uchun o‘zgartirish','Generate a separate vary cache copy for the mini cart when the cart is not empty.'=>'Savatcha bo\'sh bo\'lmaganda mini savatcha uchun alohida vary kesh nusxasini yarating.','If your theme does not use JS to update the mini cart, you must enable this option to display the correct cart contents.'=>'Agar nestingiz mini savatni yangilash uchun JS\'dan foydalanmasa, savatning to\'g\'ri tarkibini ko\'rsatish uchun ushbu parametrni yoqishingiz kerak.','New Developer Version Available!'=>'Yangi dasturchi versiyasi mavjud!','New developer version %s is available now.'=>'Yangi dasturchi versiyasi %s hozir mavjud.','Upgrade'=>'Yangilash','Purge'=>'Tozalash','Excludes'=>'Istisno qiladi','Object'=>'Obyekt','Browser'=>'Brauzer','Advanced'=>'Kengaytirilgan','Zinn® Cache Engine Network Cache Settings'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine Tarmoq Kesh Sozlamalari','TTL'=>'TTL','ESI'=>'ESI','Zinn® Cache Engine Settings'=>'Zinn® Kesh mexanizmi sozlamalari','NOTE'=>'ESLATMA','More settings available under %s menu'=>'Qo\'shimcha sozlamalar %s menyusi ostida mavjud','Advanced Settings'=>'Kengaytirilgan sozlamalar','Cache Control Settings'=>'Keshni boshqarish sozlamalari','Network Enable Cache'=>'Tarmoq keshini yoqish','Enabling Zinn® Cache Engine for WordPress here enables the cache for the network.'=>'Bu yerda WordPress uchun Zinn® Cache Engine\'ni yoqish tarmoq uchun keshni faollashtiradi.','It is STRONGLY recommended that the compatibility with other plugins on a single/few sites is tested first.'=>'Bitta yoki bir nechta saytlarda boshqa plaginlar bilan mos kelishini avval sinab ko‘rish QAT’IY TAVSIYA ETILADI.','This is to ensure compatibility prior to enabling the cache for all sites.'=>'Bu barcha saytlar uchun keshni yoqishdan oldin moslikni ta\'minlash uchundir.','Exclude Settings'=>'Sozlamalarni istisno qilish','Purge Settings'=>'Sozlamalarni tozalash','These settings are meant for ADVANCED USERS ONLY.'=>'Bu sozlamalar FAQAT TAJRIBALI FOYDALANUVCHILAR UCHUN mo\'ljallangan.','Specify an AJAX action in POST/GET and the number of seconds to cache that request, separated by a space.'=>'POST/GET so\'rovida AJAX amalini va ushbu so\'rovni keshda saqlash soniyasini bo\'sh joy bilan ajratib ko\'rsating.','Enable this option if you are using both HTTP and HTTPS in the same domain and are noticing cache irregularities.'=>'Agar bir xil domenda ham HTTP, ham HTTPS\'dan foydalanayotgan bo\'lsangiz va keshda nosozliklar sezilayotgan bo\'lsa, ushbu opsiyani yoqing.','When a visitor hovers over a page link, preload that page. This will speed up the visit to that link.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchi sahifa havolasi ustiga kelganda, o‘sha sahifani oldindan yuklang. Bu ushbu havolaga tashrif buyurish tezligini oshiradi.','This will generate extra requests to the server, which will increase server load.'=>'Bu serverga qo\'shimcha so\'rovlar yuborilishiga olib keladi, bu esa server yuklamasini oshiradi.','Use Network Admin Setting'=>'Tarmoq administratorining sozlamasidan foydalanish','Please visit the %sInformation%s page on how to test the cache.'=>'Keshni qanday sinovdan o\'tkazish bo\'yicha %sMa\'lumot%s sahifasiga tashrif buyuring.','NOTICE'=>'BILDIRISHNOMA','When disabling the cache, all cached entries for this site will be purged.'=>'Kesh o\'chirilganda, ushbu sayt uchun barcha keshga olingan yozuvlar tozalanadi.','The network admin setting can be overridden here.'=>'Tarmoq administratori sozlamasini bu yerda bekor qilish mumkin.','Privately cache frontend pages for logged-in users. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Tizimga kirgan foydalanuvchilar uchun frontend sahifalarini maxfiy tarzda keshlang. (LSWS %s talab qilinadi)','Privately cache commenters that have pending comments. Disabling this option will serve non-cacheable pages to commenters. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Kutilayotgan sharhlarga ega bo\'lgan sharhlovchilarni maxfiy ravishda keshga saqlash. Ushbu parametrni o\'chirish sharhlovchilarga keshlanmaydigan sahifalarni taqdim etadi. (LSWS %s talab qilinadi)','Cache requests made by WordPress REST API calls.'=>'WordPress REST API so\'rovlari tomonidan qilingan kesh so\'rovlari.','Disabling this option may negatively affect performance.'=>'Ushbu parametrni o\'chirish ishlash tezligiga salbiy ta\'sir ko\'rsatishi mumkin.','URI Paths containing these strings will NOT be cached as public.'=>'Ushbu satrlarni o\'z ichiga olgan URI yo\'llari ochiq (public) sifatida keshlanmaydi.','Paths containing these strings will be cached regardless of no-cacheable settings.'=>'Ushbu qatorlarni o\'z ichiga olgan yo\'llar keshlanmaydigan sozlamalardan qat\'i nazar keshlanadi.','To define a custom TTL for a URI, add a space followed by the TTL value to the end of the URI.'=>'URI uchun maxsus TTL belgilash uchun URI oxiriga bo‘sh joy va uning ortidan TTL qiymatini qo‘shing.','For example, %1$s defines a TTL of %2$s seconds for %3$s.'=>'Masalan, %1$s %3$s uchun %2$s soniya TTL ni belgilaydi.','Paths containing these strings will be forced to public cached regardless of no-cacheable settings.'=>'Ushbu qatorlarni oʻz ichiga olgan yoʻllar keshlanmaydigan sozlamalardan qatʼi nazar, majburiy ravishda ochiq keshga joylashtiriladi.','ESI Settings'=>'ESI sozlamalari','With ESI (Edge Side Includes), pages may be served from cache for logged-in users.'=>'ESI (Edge Side Includes) yordamida sahifalarni tizimga kirgan foydalanuvchilar uchun keshdan taqdim etish mumkin.','ESI allows you to designate parts of your dynamic page as separate fragments that are then assembled together to make the whole page. In other words, ESI lets you “punch holes” in a page, and then fill those holes with content that may be cached privately, cached publicly with its own TTL, or not cached at all.'=>'ESI dinamik sahifangizning qismlarini alohida fragmentlar sifatida belgilash imkonini beradi, ular keyinchalik butun sahifani hosil qilish uchun yig\'iladi. Boshqacha qilib aytganda, ESI sahifada “teshiklar ochish” va keyin bu teshiklarni shaxsiy ravishda keshlanishi, o\'z TTL qiymati bilan ommaviy ravishda keshlanishi yoki umuman keshlanmasligi mumkin bo\'lgan kontent bilan to\'ldirish imkonini beradi.','WpW: Private Cache vs. Public Cache'=>'WpW: Shaxsiy kesh va Ommaviy kesh','You can turn shortcodes into ESI blocks.'=>'Qisqa kodlarni ESI bloklariga aylantirishingiz mumkin.','Replace %1$s with %2$s.'=>'%1$s ni %2$s bilan almashtirish.','ESI sample for developers'=>'Dasturchilar uchun ESI namunasi','WARNING'=>'OGOHLANTIRISH','These options are only available with LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server.'=>'Bu parametrlar faqat LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server bilan mavjud.','Turn ON to cache public pages for logged in users, and serve the Admin Bar and Comment Form via ESI blocks. These two blocks will be uncached unless enabled below.'=>'Tizimga kirgan foydalanuvchilar uchun ommaviy sahifalarni keshda saqlash va Admin paneli hamda Izoh formasini ESI bloklari orqali taqdim etish uchun yoqing. Ushbu ikki blok quyida faollashtirilmaguncha keshlanmaydi.','Cache the built-in Admin Bar ESI block.'=>'O‘rnatilgan Admin Bar ESI blokini keshga saqlash.','Cache the built-in Comment Form ESI block.'=>'O\'rnatilgan Comment Form ESI blokini kesh qilish.','The list will be merged with the predefined nonces in your local data file.'=>'Roʻyxat mahalliy maʼlumotlar faylingizdagi oldindan belgilangan nonces bilan birlashtiriladi.','The latest data file is'=>'Eng soʻnggi maʼlumotlar fayli bu','Filter %s is supported.'=>'%s filtri qo‘llab-quvvatlanadi.','The above nonces will be converted to ESI automatically.'=>'Yuqoridagi nonceni avtomatik ravishda ESI ga o\'tkaziladi.','An optional second parameter may be used to specify cache control. Use a space to separate'=>'Keshni boshqarishni ko\'rsatish uchun ixtiyoriy ikkinchi parametr ishlatilishi mumkin. Ajratish uchun probel ishlating','Wildcard %1$s supported (match zero or more characters). For example, to match %2$s and %3$s, use %4$s.'=>'Shablon belgisi %1$s qo‘llab-quvvatlanadi (nol yoki undan ortiq belgiga mos keladi). Masalan, %2$s va %3$s bilan mos kelishi uchun %4$s dan foydalaning.','If your site contains public content that certain user roles can see but other roles cannot, you can specify a Vary Group for those user roles. For example, specifying an administrator vary group allows there to be a separate publicly-cached page tailored to administrators (with “edit” links, etc), while all other user roles see the default public page.'=>'Agar saytingizda maʼlum foydalanuvchi rollari ko‘rishi mumkin bo‘lgan, lekin boshqa rollar ko‘ra olmaydigan ommaviy kontent mavjud bo‘lsa, ushbu foydalanuvchi rollari uchun Vary Group belgilashingiz mumkin. Masalan, administratorlar vary guruhini belgilash orqali administratorlarga moslashtirilgan (“tahrirlash” havolalari va boshqalar bilan) alohida ommaviy keshga qo‘yilgan sahifani yaratish mumkin, boshqa barcha foydalanuvchi rollari esa standart ommaviy sahifani ko‘radi.','Paths containing these strings will not be cached.'=>'Ushbu qatorlarni o\'z ichiga olgan yo\'llar keshlanmaydi.','Predefined list will also be combined w/ the above settings'=>'Oldindan belgilangan roʻyxat yuqoridagi parametrlar bilan ham birlashtiriladi','Query strings containing these parameters will not be cached.'=>'Ushbu parametrlarni o\'z ichiga olgan so\'rov qatorlari keshlanmaydi.','For example, for %1$s, %2$s and %3$s can be used here.'=>'Masalan, bu yerda %1$s, %2$s va %3$s ishlatilishi mumkin.','All categories are cached by default.'=>'Barcha kategoriyalar sukut bo\'yicha keshlanadi.','To prevent %s from being cached, enter them here.'=>'%s keshlanishining oldini olish uchun ularni shu yerga kiriting.','categories'=>'kategoriyalar','If the category name is not found, the category will be removed from the list on save.'=>'Agar kategoriya nomi topilmasa, kategoriya saqlash vaqtida ro\'yxatdan o\'chiriladi.','All tags are cached by default.'=>'Barcha teglar standart bo\'yicha keshlanadi.','tags'=>'teglar','If the tag slug is not found, the tag will be removed from the list on save.'=>'Agar teg slug topilmasa, saqlash vaqtida teg ro\'yxatdan o\'chiriladi.','To exclude %1$s, insert %2$s.'=>'%1$s ni istisno qilish uchun %2$s ni kiriting.','Selected roles will be excluded from cache.'=>'Tanlangan rollar keshdan chiqarib tashlanadi.','All pages'=>'Barcha sahifalar','Front page'=>'Bosh sahifa','Home page'=>'Asosiy sahifa','Pages'=>'Sahifalar','All pages with Recent Posts Widget'=>'So\'nggi xabarlar vidjeti mavjud bo\'lgan barcha sahifalar','Author archive'=>'Muallif arxivi','Post type archive'=>'Maqola turi arxivi','Yearly archive'=>'Yillik arxiv','Monthly archive'=>'Oylik arxiv','Daily archive'=>'Kunlik arxiv','Term archive (include category, tag, and tax)'=>'Termlar arxivi (kategoriya, teg va soliqni o\'z ichiga oladi)','Auto Purge Rules For Publish/Update'=>'Chop etish/Yangilash uchun avtomatik tozalash qoidalari','Note'=>'Eslatma','Select "All" if there are dynamic widgets linked to posts on pages other than the front or home pages.'=>'Agar asosiy yoki bosh sahifadan tashqari boshqa sahifalardagi postlarga ulangan dinamik vidjetlar mavjud bo\'lsa, "Barchasi"ni tanlang.','Other checkboxes will be ignored.'=>'Boshqa katakchalar e\'tiborga olinmaydi.','Select only the archive types that are currently used, the others can be left unchecked.'=>'Faqat hozirda ishlatilayotgan arxiv turlarini tanlang, qolganlarini belgisiz qoldirish mumkin.','Select which pages will be automatically purged when posts are published/updated.'=>'Postlar e\'lon qilinganda yoki yangilanganda qaysi sahifalar avtomatik ravishda tozalinishini tanlang.','If ON, the stale copy of a cached page will be shown to visitors until a new cache copy is available. Reduces the server load for following visits. If OFF, the page will be dynamically generated while visitors wait.'=>'Yoqilgan bo\'lsa, yangi keshlangan nusxasi mavjud bo\'lgunga qadar tashrif buyuruvchilarga sahifaning eskirgan nusxasi ko\'rsatiladi. Keyingi tashriflar uchun server yuklamasini kamaytiradi. O\'chirilgan bo\'lsa, tashrif buyuruvchilar kutayotgan vaqtda sahifa dinamik ravishda yaratiladi.','By design, this option may serve stale content. Do not enable this option, if that is not OK with you.'=>'O‘ziga xos xususiyatiga ko‘ra, bu parametr eskirgan kontentni taqdim etishi mumkin. Agar bu sizga to‘g‘ri kelmasa, ushbu parametrni yoqmang.','The URLs here (one per line) will be purged automatically at the time set in the option "%s".'=>'Bu yerdagi URL manzillari (har bir qatorda bittadan) "%s" parametrida o\'rnatilgan vaqtda avtomatik ravishda tozalanadi.','Both %1$s and %2$s are acceptable.'=>'%1$s ham, %2$s ham maqbul.','For URLs with wildcards, there may be a delay in initiating scheduled purge.'=>'Shablonli URL manzillar uchun rejalashtirilgan tozalashni boshlashda kechikish bo\'lishi mumkin.','Specify the time to purge the "%s" list.'=>'"%s" roʻyxatini tozalash vaqtini koʻrsating.','Current server time is %s.'=>'Joriy server vaqti: %s.','A Purge All will be executed when WordPress runs these hooks.'=>'WordPress ushbu ilgaklarni bajarganda Tozalash barchasi bajariladi.','Specify how long, in seconds, public pages are cached.'=>'Ochiq sahifalar qancha vaqt, soniyalarda keshlanishini ko\'rsating.','Specify how long, in seconds, private pages are cached.'=>'Xususiy sahifalar qancha vaqt, sekundlarda keshlanishini ko‘rsating.','Specify how long, in seconds, the front page is cached.'=>'Bosh sahifa keshlanish vaqtini sekundlarda ko\'rsating.','Specify how long, in seconds, feeds are cached.'=>'Lentalarning qancha vaqt, soniyalarda keshlanishini ko\'rsating.','If this is set to a number less than 30, feeds will not be cached.'=>'Agar bu 30 dan kichik raqamga o\'rnatilsa, lentalar keshlanmaydi.','Specify how long, in seconds, REST calls are cached.'=>'REST chaqiruvlari qancha vaqt, soniyalarda keshlanishini ko\'rsating.','Specify an HTTP status code and the number of seconds to cache that page, separated by a space.'=>'HTTP holat kodini va ushbu sahifani keshda saqlash vaqtini soniyalarda kiriting, ularni bo\'sh joy bilan ajrating.','Browser Cache Settings'=>'Brauzer keshini sozlash','OpenLiteSpeed users please check this'=>'OpenLiteSpeed ​​foydalanuvchilari, iltimos, buni tekshiring','Setting Up Custom Headers'=>'Maxsus sarlavhalarni sozlash','Browser caching stores static files locally in the user\'s browser. Turn on this setting to reduce repeated requests for static files.'=>'Brauzer keshi statik fayllarni foydalanuvchi brauzerida lokal tarzda saqlaydi. Statik fayllar uchun takroriy so\'rovlarni kamaytirish uchun ushbu sozlamani yoqing.','You can turn on browser caching in server admin too. %sLearn more about LiteSpeed browser cache settings%s.'=>'Siz server administratorida ham brauzer keshini yoqishingiz mumkin. %sLiteSpeed brauzeri kesh sozlamalari haqida ko\'proq bilib oling%s.','The amount of time, in seconds, that files will be stored in browser cache before expiring.'=>'Fayllarning muddati tugashidan oldin brauzer keshida saqlanish vaqti (soniyalarda).','Ignore certain query strings when caching. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Keshni xotirada saqlashda ayrim soʻrov qatorlarini eʼtiborsiz qoldirish. (LSWS %s talab qilinadi)','For example, to drop parameters beginning with %1$s, %2$s can be used here.'=>'Masalan, %1$s bilan boshlanadigan parametrlarni oʻchirish uchun bu yerda %2$s ishlatilishi mumkin.','Serve a separate cache copy for mobile visitors.'=>'Mobil tashrif buyuruvchilar uchun alohida kesh nusxasini taqdim eting.','Learn more about when this is needed'=>'Buning qachon kerakligi haqida ko\'proq bilib oling','Htaccess did not match configuration option.'=>'Htaccess konfiguratsiya parametriga mos kelmadi.','Htaccess rule is: %s'=>'Htaccess qoidasi: %s','If %1$s is %2$s, then %3$s must be populated!'=>'Agar %1$s %2$s boʻlsa, u holda %3$s toʻldirilishi shart!','cookies'=>'Cookie-fayllar','user agents'=>'foydalanuvchi agentlari','SYNTAX: alphanumeric and "_". No spaces and case sensitive. MUST BE UNIQUE FROM OTHER WEB APPLICATIONS.'=>'SINTAKSIS: harflar, raqamlar va "_". Bo‘sh joylarsiz va bosh-kichik harflarga sezgir. BOSHQA VEB-ILOVALARDAN NOYOB BO‘LISHI SHART.','The default login cookie is %s.'=>'Standart kirish kukisi %s hisoblanadi.','The server will determine if the user is logged in based on the existence of this cookie.'=>'Server ushbu kuki mavjudligiga asoslanib foydalanuvchi tizimga kirgan yoki kirmaganligini aniqlaydi.','This setting is useful for those that have multiple web applications for the same domain.'=>'Bu parametr bitta domen uchun bir nechta veb-ilovaga ega bo\'lganlar uchun foydalidir.','If every web application uses the same cookie, the server may confuse whether a user is logged in or not.'=>'Agar har bir veb-ilova bir xil cookie\'dan foydalansa, server foydalanuvchi tizimga kirganmi yoki yo\'qligini adashtirib yuborishi mumkin.','The cookie set here will be used for this WordPress installation.'=>'Bu yerda o\'rnatilgan cookie fayli ushbu WordPress o\'rnatishi uchun ishlatiladi.','Example use case:'=>'Foydalanish holati namunasi:','There is a WordPress installed for %s.'=>'%s uchun WordPress o\'rnatilgan.','Then another WordPress is installed (NOT MULTISITE) at %s'=>'So\'ngra %s manzilida boshqa WordPress (KO\'P SAYTLI EMAS) o\'rnatiladi','The cache needs to distinguish who is logged into which WordPress site in order to cache correctly.'=>'To\'g\'ri kesh qilish uchun kesh qaysi WordPress saytiga kim kirganini farqlashi kerak.','Invalid login cookie. Invalid characters found.'=>'Yaroqsiz kirish kukisi. Yaroqsiz belgilar topildi.','WARNING: The .htaccess login cookie and Database login cookie do not match.'=>'DIQQAT: .htaccess kirish kuki va Ma\'lumotlar bazasiga kirish kuki mos kelmayapti.','SYNTAX: alphanumeric and "_". No spaces and case sensitive.'=>'SINTAKS: harflar, raqamlar va "_". Bo‘sh joylarsiz va harf kattaligiga sezgir.','You can list the 3rd party vary cookies here.'=>'Uchinchi tomonning turli xil fayllarini (cookies) shu yerda ko\'rsatishingiz mumkin.','Enabled'=>'Faollashtirilgan','Disabled'=>'O\'chirilgan','Not Available'=>'Mavjud emas','Passed'=>'Muvaffaqiyatli o\'tdi','Failed'=>'Muvaffaqiyatsiz','Object Cache Settings'=>'Obyekt kesh sozlamalari','Use external object cache functionality.'=>'Tashqi obyekt kesh funksionalligidan foydalaning.','Status'=>'Holat','%s Extension'=>'%s Kengaytmasi','Connection Test'=>'Ulanishni sinash','Your %s Hostname or IP address.'=>'Sizning %s xost nomingiz yoki IP manzilingiz.','If you are using a %1$s socket, %2$s should be set to %3$s'=>'Agar siz %1$s soketidan foydalanayotgan bo\'lsangiz, %2$s qiymatini %3$s qilib belgilash kerak','Default port for %1$s is %2$s.'=>'%1$s uchun standart port %2$s.','Default TTL for cached objects.'=>'Keshidlangan obyektlar uchun standart TTL.','Only available when %s is installed.'=>'Faqatgina %s o\'rnatilganda mavjud.','Specify the password used when connecting.'=>'Ulanishda ishlatiladigan parolni kiriting.','Database to be used'=>'Foydalaniladigan ma\'lumotlar bazasi','Groups cached at the network level.'=>'Guruhlar tarmoq darajasida keshlandi.','Use keep-alive connections to speed up cache operations.'=>'Kesh amallarini tezlashtirish uchun keep-alive ulanishlaridan foydalaning.','Improve wp-admin speed through caching. (May encounter expired data)'=>'Kesh xotirasi orqali wp-admin tezligini oshiring. (Eski ma\'lumotlarga duch kelishi mumkin)','When enabled, the cache will automatically purge when any plugin, theme or the WordPress core is upgraded.'=>'Yoqilganda, har qanday plagin, tema yoki WordPress core yangilanganda kesh avtomatik ravishda tozalanadi.','Cloudflare Settings'=>'Cloudflare Sozlamalari','Use %s API functionality.'=>'%s API funksionalligidan foydalanish.','Global API Key / API Token'=>'Global API Kaliti / API Tokeni','Your API key / token is used to access %s APIs.'=>'Sizning API kalitingiz / tokeningiz %s API\'lariga kirish uchun ishlatiladi.','Get it from %s.'=>'%s dan oling.','Recommended to generate the token from Cloudflare API token template "WordPress".'=>'Cloudflare API token template "WordPress" shablonidan tokenni yaratish tavsiya etiladi.','Email Address'=>'Elektron pochta manzili','Your Email address on %s.'=>'%s da elektron pochta manzilingiz.','Optional when API token used.'=>'API token ishlatilganda ixtiyoriy.','Domain'=>'Domen','You can just type part of the domain.'=>'Domen nomining faqat bir qismini kiritishingiz mumkin.','Once saved, it will be matched with the current list and completed automatically.'=>'Saqlangach, u joriy ro‘yxat bilan solishtiriladi va avtomatik ravishda yakunlanadi.','Clear %s cache when "Purge All" is run.'=>'"Barchasini tozalash" ishga tushirilganda %s keshini tozalash.','To enable the following functionality, turn ON Cloudflare API in CDN Settings.'=>'Quyidagi funksionallikni faollashtirish uchun CDN Sozlamalarida Cloudflare API\'ni yoqing.','Cloudflare Domain'=>'Cloudflare domeni','Cloudflare Zone'=>'Cloudflare Zoni','Development Mode'=>'Dasturlash rejimi','Turn ON'=>'Yoqish','Turn OFF'=>'O‘chirish','Check Status'=>'Holatni tekshirish','Current status is %1$s since %2$s.'=>'%2$s dan beri joriy holat: %1$s.','Current status is %s.'=>'Joriy holat: %s.','Development mode will be automatically turned off in %s.'=>'Ishlab chiqish rejimi %s ichida avtomatik ravishda o\'chiriladi.','Temporarily bypass Cloudflare cache. This allows changes to the origin server to be seen in realtime.'=>'Cloudflare keshini vaqtincha chetlab o\'tish. Bu bosh serverdagi o\'zgarishlarni real vaqt rejimida ko\'rish imkonini beradi.','Development Mode will be turned off automatically after three hours.'=>'Dasturlash rejimi uch soatdan keyin avtomatik ravishda oʻchiriladi.','%1$sLearn More%2$s'=>'%1$sBatafsil ma\'lumot%2$s','Cloudflare Cache'=>'Cloudflare Kesh','Purge Everything'=>'Hammasini tozalash','Other Static CDN'=>'Boshqa statik CDN','Zinn® Cache Engine CDN'=>'Zinn® kesh tizimi CDN','CDN Settings'=>'CDN sozlamalari','Turn this setting %s if you are using a traditional Content Delivery Network (CDN) or a subdomain for static content.'=>'Agar an\'anaviy kontent yetkazib berish tarmog‘i (CDN) yoki statik kontent uchun subdomen ishlatayotgan bo‘lsangiz, ushbu sozlamani %s qilib qo‘ying.','NOTE: Cloudflare does not use CDN Mapping. If you are only using Cloudflare, leave this setting %s.'=>'ESLATMA: Cloudflare CDN xaritalashdan foydalanmaydi. Agar siz faqat Cloudflare\'dan foydalanayotgan bo\'lsangiz, ushbu sozlamani %s qoldiring.','To randomize CDN hostname, define multiple hostnames for the same resources.'=>'CDN xost nomini tasodifiy qilish uchun bir xil resurslar uchun bir nechta xost nomlarini belgilang.','Serve all image files through the CDN. This will affect all attachments, HTML %1$s tags, and CSS %2$s attributes.'=>'Barcha rasm fayllarini CDN orqali uzating. Bu barcha ilovalarga, HTML %1$s teglariga va CSS %2$s atributlariga ta\'sir qiladi.','Serve all CSS files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP CSS files.'=>'Barcha CSS fayllarini CDN orqali yetkazib bering. Bu navbatga qo\'yilgan barcha WP CSS fayllariga ta\'sir qiladi.','Serve all JavaScript files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP JavaScript files.'=>'Barcha JavaScript fayllarini CDN orqali yetkazib bering. Bu navbatga qo‘yilgan barcha WP JavaScript fayllariga ta\'sir qiladi.','Static file type links to be replaced by CDN links.'=>'CDN havolalariga almashtiriladigan statik fayl turi havolalari.','This will affect all tags containing attributes: %s.'=>'Bu %s atributini o\'z ichida saqlagan barcha teglarga ta\'sir qiladi.','If you turn any of the above settings OFF, please remove the related file types from the %s box.'=>'Yuqoridagi sozlamalardan birortasini O‘CHIRsangiz, iltimos, tegishli fayl turlarini %s katagidan olib tashlang.','Specify which HTML element attributes will be replaced with CDN Mapping.'=>'CDN Mapping yordamida qaysi HTML element atributlari almashtirilishini ko\'rsating.','Only attributes listed here will be replaced.'=>'Faqat shu yerda ko\'rsatilgan atributlar almashtiriladi.','Use the format %1$s or %2$s (element is optional).'=>'%1$s yoki %2$s formatidan foydalaning (element ixtiyoriy).','Site URL to be served through the CDN. Beginning with %1$s. For example, %2$s.'=>'CDN орqали узатиладиган сайт URL манзили. %1$s дан бошланади. Масалан, %2$s.','Only files within these directories will be pointed to the CDN.'=>'Faqat ushbu kataloglardagi fayllargina CDN ga yo\'naltiriladi.','Paths containing these strings will not be served from the CDN.'=>'Ushbu qatorlarni oʻz ichiga olgan yoʻllarga CDN orqali xizmat koʻrsatilmaydi.','Are you sure to delete all existing blocklist items?'=>'Barcha mavjud blok-roʻyxat elementlarini oʻchirishni xohlaysizmi?','Empty blocklist'=>'Qora roʻyxatni tozalash','Blocklist'=>'Bloklanganlar ro\'yxati','Total'=>'Jami','URL'=>'URL','Operation'=>'Amaliyot','Remove from Blocklist'=>'Qora roʻyxatdan chiqarish','API: PHP Constant %s available to disable blocklist.'=>'API: Bloklar roʻyxatini oʻchirib qoʻyish uchun PHP %s konstantasi mavjud.','API: Filter %s available to disable blocklist.'=>'API: Bloklash roʻyxatini oʻchirish uchun %s filtri mavjud.','Not blocklisted'=>'Bloklangan emas','Blocklisted due to not cacheable'=>'Keshlanmaydiganligi sababli bloklangan','Blocklisted'=>'Qora roʻyxatga kiritilgan','Summary'=>'Xulosa','Map'=>'Bog‘lash','Zinn® Cache Engine Crawler'=>'Zinn® Kesh Dvigatel Skaneri','Clean Crawler Map'=>'Qidiruvchi xaritasini tozalash','Refresh Crawler Map'=>'Qidiruv xaritasini yangilash','Generated at %s'=>'%s da yaratilgan','Sitemap List'=>'Sayt xaritasi roʻyxati','Sitemap Total'=>'Sayt xaritasi jami','URL Search'=>'URL qidirish','Cache Hit'=>'Kesh topilishi','Cache Miss'=>'Kesh topilmadi','Crawler Status'=>'Kreyper holati','Add to Blocklist'=>'Bloklash roʻyxatiga qoʻshish','Crawler General Settings'=>'Skanerlashning umumiy sozlamalari','This will enable crawler cron.'=>'Bu skanerlash kronini faollashtiradi.','Specify how long in seconds before the crawler should initiate crawling the entire sitemap again.'=>'Krouler butun sayt xaritasini qayta skanerlashni boshlashidan oldin qancha vaqt o‘tishi kerakligini soniyalarda ko‘rsating.','The crawler will use your XML sitemap or sitemap index. Enter the full URL to your sitemap here.'=>'Qidiruv botingiz XML sayt xaritaniz yoki sayt xaritasi indeksidan foydalanadi. Sayt xaritaning toʻliq URL manzilini shu yerga kiriting.','The maximum average server load allowed while crawling. The number of crawler threads in use will be actively reduced until average server load falls under this limit. If this cannot be achieved with a single thread, the current crawler run will be terminated.'=>'Kraningiz jarayonida ruxsat etilgan maksimal o‘rtacha server yuklamasi. Serverning o‘rtacha yuklamasi ushbu chegaradan pastga tushguncha ishlatilayotgan krerer oqimlari soni faol ravishda kamaytiriladi. Agar bunga bitta oqim yordamida erishib bo\'lmasa, joriy krerer ishlashi to\'xtatiladi.','Server enforced value: %s'=>'Server majburiy qiymati: %s','Server allowed max value: %s'=>'Server ruxsat berilgan maksimal qiymat: %s','To crawl the site as a logged-in user, enter the user ids to be simulated.'=>'Saytni tizimga kirgan foydalanuvchi sifatida skanerlash uchun simulyatsiya qilinadigan foydalanuvchi identifikatorlarini kiriting.','You must set %s before using this feature.'=>'Ushbu funksiyadan foydalanishdan oldin %s ni o‘rnatishingiz kerak.','Click here to set.'=>'O\'rnatish uchun shu yerni bosing.','You must set %1$s to %2$s before using this feature.'=>'Ushbu funksiyadan foydalanishdan oldin %1$s ni %2$s qilib belgilashingiz kerak.','To crawl for a particular cookie, enter the cookie name, and the values you wish to crawl for. Values should be one per line. There will be one crawler created per cookie value, per simulated role.'=>'Muayyan cookie-faylni skanerlash uchun cookie nomi va skanerlashni istagan qiymatlaringizni kiriting. Qiymatlar har bir qatorda bittadan bo\'lishi kerak. Har bir simulyatsiya qilingan rol va cookie qiymati uchun bitta skaner yaratiladi.','Use %1$s in %2$s to indicate this cookie has not been set.'=>'Ushbu kukining o‘rnatilmaganligini bildirish uchun %2$s da %1$s dan foydalaning.','You need to set the %s in Settings first before using the crawler'=>'Kroulerni ishlatishdan oldin avval Sozlamalar bo\'limida %s ni o\'rnatishingiz kerak','Crawler Cron'=>'Krouler kroni','The crawler feature is not enabled on the LiteSpeed server. Please consult your server admin or hosting provider.'=>'LiteSpeed server\'ida crawler funksiyasi yoqilmagan. Iltimos, server administratori yoki xosting provayderingizga murojaat qiling.','See %sIntroduction for Enabling the Crawler%s for detailed information.'=>'Batafsil ma\'lumot uchun %sQidiruv botini faollashtirish bo\'yicha kirish qismiga%s qarang.','Current sitemap crawl started at'=>'Joriy sayt xaritasi skanerlash boshlandi','The next complete sitemap crawl will start at'=>'Keyingi to\'liq sayt xaritasi skanerlashi boshlanadi:','Last complete run time for all crawlers'=>'Barcha qidiruv botlari uchun oxirgi to‘liq bajarilish vaqti','%d seconds'=>'%d soniya','Run time for previous crawler'=>'Oldingi skanerlash uchun bajarilish vaqti','Current crawler started at'=>'Joriy skanerlash boshlangan vaqt:','Current server load'=>'Joriy server yuklamasi','Last interval'=>'Oxirgi oraliq','Ended reason'=>'Tugash sababi','Last crawled'=>'Oxirgi marta tekshirilgan','%d item(s)'=>'%d ta element','Reset position'=>'Pozitsiyani tiklash','Manually run'=>'Qo\'lda ishga tushirish','Cron Name'=>'Cron nomi','Run Frequency'=>'Bajarilish chastotasi','Activate'=>'Faollashtirish','Running'=>'Ishlamqda','Waiting'=>'Kutilmoqda','Hit'=>'Bosish','Miss'=>'O\'tkazib yuborish','Position: '=>'O‘rni:','running'=>'ishlayapti','Waiting to be Crawled'=>'Indekslash kutilmoqda','Already Cached'=>'Keshdan o\'tgan','Successfully Crawled'=>'Muvaffaqiyatli indekslandi','Run frequency is set by the Interval Between Runs setting.'=>'Bajarilish chastotasi Bajarilishlar orasidagi interval sozlamasi orqali belgilanadi.','Crawlers cannot run concurrently. If both the cron and a manual run start at similar times, the first to be started will take precedence.'=>'Skanerlar bir vaqtning o\'zida ishlay olmaydi. Agar cron va qo\'lda ishga tushirish bir vaqtda boshlansa, birinchi bo\'lib boshlangani ustunlikka ega bo\'ladi.','Please see %sHooking WP-Cron Into the System Task Scheduler%s to learn how to create the system cron task.'=>'Tizim cron vazifasini qanday yaratishni o‘rganish uchun %sHooking WP-Cron Into the System Task Scheduler%s qismiga qarang.','Watch Crawler Status'=>'Kuzatuvchi holatini ko\'rish','Show crawler status'=>'Krawlerv holatini ko‘rsatish','Start watching...'=>'Kuzatishni boshlash...','No crawler meta file generated yet'=>'Hali hech qanday qidiruv tizimi skaneri meta-fayli yaratilmagan','Cache Status'=>'Kesh holati','More'=>'Ko\'proq','Public Cache'=>'Ochiq kesh','Private Cache'=>'Shaxsiy kesh','Crawler(s)'=>'Skaner(lar)','Currently active crawler'=>'Hozirda faol skaner','%1$s %2$d item(s)'=>'%1$s %2$d ta element','Last crawled:'=>'Oxirgi marta tekshirilgan:','News'=>'Yangiliklar','Network Dashboard'=>'Tarmoq boshqaruv paneli','Zinn® Cache Engine Dashboard'=>'Zinn® Kesh mexanizmi boshqaruv paneli','Usage Statistics: %s'=>'Foydalanish statistikasi: %s','CDN Bandwidth'=>'CDN o\'tkazish qobiliyati','Low Quality Image Placeholder'=>'Past past sifatli tasvir o\'rni','Fast Queue Usage'=>'Tezkor navbatdan foydalanish','Usage'=>'Foydalanish','Pay as You Go'=>'Ishlatganingizcha to\'lash','PAYG Balance'=>'Oylik balans','This Month Usage: %s'=>'Joriy oyda foydalanish: %s','Pay as You Go Usage Statistics'=>'Foydalanish bo\'yicha ishlatilganda to\'lash statistikasi','Total Usage'=>'Jami foydalanish','Total images optimized in this month'=>'Ushbu oyda optimallashtirilgan jami rasmlar','DB Optimization Settings'=>'Ma\'lumotlar bazasini optimallashtirish sozlamalari','Zinn® Cache Engine Database Optimization'=>'Zinn® kesh mexanizmi ma\'lumotlar bazasini optimallashtirish','Clean All'=>'Barchasini tozalash','Post Revisions'=>'Xabar tahrirlari','Clean all post revisions'=>'Barcha post tahrirlarini tozalash','Orphaned Post Meta'=>'Yetim post meta ma\'lumotlari','Clean all orphaned post meta records'=>'Barcha egasi yo\'q post meta yozuvlarini tozalash','Auto Drafts'=>'Avtomatik qoralasmalar','Clean all auto saved drafts'=>'Barcha avtomatik saqlangan qoralmalarni tozalash','Trashed Posts'=>'Oʻchirilgan xabarlar','Clean all trashed posts and pages'=>'Barcha o\'chirilgan yozuvlar va sahifalarni tozalash','Spam Comments'=>'Spam izohlar','Clean all spam comments'=>'Barcha spam izohlarni tozalash','Trashed Comments'=>'O\'chirilgan izohlar','Clean all trashed comments'=>'Barcha oʻchirilgan izohlarni tozalash','Trackbacks/Pingbacks'=>'Trekbeklar/Pingbeklar','Clean all trackbacks and pingbacks'=>'Barcha trekbeklar va pingbeklarni tozalash','Expired Transients'=>'Muddati oʻtgan vaqtinchalik maʼlumotlar','Clean expired transient options'=>'Muddati o\'tgan vaqtinchalik parametrlarni tozalash','All Transients'=>'Barcha vaqtinchalik ma\'lumotlar','Clean all transient options'=>'Barcha vaqtinchalik opsiyalarni tozalash','Optimize Tables'=>'Jadvallarni optimallashtirish','Optimize all tables in your database'=>'Maʼlumotlar bazangizdagi barcha jadvallarni optimallashtiring','Clean revisions older than %1$s day(s), excluding %2$s latest revisions'=>'%1$s kundan eski tahrirlarni tozalash, oxirgi %2$s ta tahrirni istisno qilish','Database Optimizer'=>'Ma\'lumotlar bazasini optimallashtiruvchi','Database Table Engine Converter'=>'Ma\'lumotlar bazasi jadvali mexanizmi konverteri','Table'=>'Jadval','Engine'=>'Dvigatel','Tool'=>'Vosita','Convert to InnoDB'=>'InnoDB-ga o\'tkazish','We are good. No table uses MyISAM engine.'=>'Biz yaxshimiz. Hech qaysi jadval MyISAM trafigidan foydalanmayapti.','Database Summary'=>'Ma\'lumotlar bazasi xulosasi','Autoload size'=>'Avtoload hajmi','Autoload entries'=>'Avtoyüklash yozuvlari','Autoload top list'=>'Eng koʻp yuklanadiganlar roʻyxati','Option Name'=>'Parametr nomi','Autoload'=>'Avtoy yuklash','Size'=>'Hajmi','Specify the number of most recent revisions to keep when cleaning revisions.'=>'Tahrirlarni tozalashda saqlab qolinadigan eng so\'nggi tahrirlar sonini ko\'rsating.','Day(s)'=>'Kun(lar)','Revisions newer than this many days will be kept when cleaning revisions.'=>'Tahrirlarni tozalashda ushbu sondagi kunlardan yangi bo\'lgan tahrirlar saqlanib qolinadi.','Public'=>'Ommaviy','Private'=>'Maxfiy','Disable'=>'O‘chirish','Widget Cache TTL'=>'Vidjet keshining TTL qiymati','Recommended value: 28800 seconds (8 hours).'=>'Tavsiya etilgan qiymat: 28800 soniya (8 soat).','A TTL of 0 indicates do not cache.'=>'0 TTL keshlamaslikni bildiradi.','General Settings'=>'Umumiy sozlamalar','Zinn® Cache Engine General Settings'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine Umumiy Sozlamalari','Use Primary Site Configuration'=>'Asosiy sayt konfiguratsiyasidan foydalanish','Check this option to use the primary site\'s configuration for all subsites.'=>'Barcha quyi saytlar uchun asosiy sayt konfiguratsiyasidan foydalanish uchun ushbu parametrni belgilang.','This will disable the settings page on all subsites.'=>'Bu barcha quyi saytlarda sozlamalar sahifasini o\'chirib qo\'yadi.','This option enables maximum optimization for Guest Mode visitors.'=>'Bu parametr Mehmon rejimi tashrif buyuruvchilari uchun maksimal optimallashtirishni faollashtiradi.','Please read all warnings before enabling this option.'=>'Ushbu parametrni yoqishdan oldin barcha ogohlantirishlarni oʻqib chiqing.','Notice'=>'Bildirishnoma','%s must be turned ON for this setting to work.'=>'Bu sozlamaning ishlashi uchun %s YOQILgan bo‘lishi kerak.','You need to turn %s on to get maximum result.'=>'Eng yaxshi natijaga erishish uchun %s ni yoqishingiz kerak.','You need to turn %s on and finish all WebP generation to get maximum result.'=>'Maksimal natijaga erishish uchun %s ni yoqishingiz va barcha WebP yaratish jarayonini yakunlashingiz kerak.','Enter this site\'s IP address to allow cloud services directly call IP instead of domain name. This eliminates the overhead of DNS and CDN lookups.'=>'Bulutli xizmatlarga domen nomi oʻrniga toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri IP manzilga murojaat qilishiga ruxsat berish uchun ushbu saytning IP manzilini kiriting. Bu DNS va CDN qidiruvlari uchun sarflanadigan vaqt va resurslarni bartaraf qiladi.','Your server IP'=>'Sizning server IP manzilingiz','Check my public IP from'=>'Mening ommaviy IP manzilimni tekshirish','the auto-detected IP may not be accurate if you have an additional outgoing IP set, or you have multiple IPs configured on your server.'=>'agar sizda qo\'shimcha chiquvchi IP o\'rnatilgan bo\'lsa yoki serveringizda bir nechta IP manzillar sozlangan bo\'lsa, avtomatik aniqlangan IP aniq bo\'lmasligi mumkin.','Please make sure this IP is the correct one for visiting your site.'=>'Iltimos, ushbu IP manzilingizga kirish uchun to\'g\'ri ekanligiga ishonch hosil qiling.','Turn this option ON to show latest news automatically, including hotfixes, new releases, available beta versions, and promotions.'=>'So\'nggi yangiliklarni, jumladan, tuzatishlar, yangi versiyalar, mavjud beta-versiyalar va aksiyalarni avtomatik ko\'rsatish uchun ushbu opsiyani YOQING.','Turn this option ON to have Zinn® Cache Engine updated automatically, whenever a new version is released. If OFF, update manually as usual.'=>'Yangi versiya chiqqanda Zinn® Cache Engine avtomatik ravishda yangilanishi uchun ushbu opsiyani YOQING. O‘CHIQ bo‘lsa, odatdagidek qo‘lda yangilang.','Guest Mode provides an always cacheable landing page for an automated guest\'s first time visit, and then attempts to update cache varies via AJAX.'=>'Mehmon rejimi avtomatlashtirilgan mehmonning birinchi tashrifi uchun doimiy keshlanadigan bosh sahifani taqdim etadi va shundan so\'ng AJAX orqali kesh o\'zgarishlarini yangilashga harakat qiladi.','This option can help to correct the cache vary for certain advanced mobile or tablet visitors.'=>'Bu parametr muayyan ilgʻor mobil yoki planshet tashrif buyuruvchilari uchun kesh farqini (cache vary) toʻgʻrilashga yordam berishi mumkin.','Guest Mode testing result'=>'Mehmon rejimi sinovi natijasi','Testing'=>'Sinovdan o‘tkazilmoqda','Guest Mode IP/UA sync status'=>'Mehmon rejimi IP/UA sinxronizatsiya holati','Syncing'=>'Sinxronlanmoqda','Guest Mode passed testing.'=>'Mehmon rejimi sinovdan o\'tdi.','Guest Mode failed to test.'=>'Mehmon rejimi sinovdan o‘ta olmadi.','Synced successfully.'=>'Muvaffaqiyatli sinxronlandi.','Sync failed.'=>'Sinxronizatsiya amalga oshmadi.','Image Optimization Summary'=>'Rasm optimallashtirish xulosasi','Image Optimization Settings'=>'Rasm optimallashtirish sozlamalari','Zinn® Cache Engine Image Optimization'=>'Zinn® Kesh Dvigatelini Tasvirni Optimallashtirish','Request WebP/AVIF versions of original images when doing optimization.'=>'Optimizatsiya qilishda asl rasmlarning WebP/AVIF versiyalarini so\'rash.','Significantly improve load time by replacing images with their optimized %s versions.'=>'Rasmlarni ularning optimallashtirilgan %s versiyalariga almashtirish orqali yuklanish vaqtini sezilarli darajada yaxshilang.','When switching formats, please %1$s or %2$s to apply this new choice to previously optimized images.'=>'Formatni o\'zgartirganda, ilgari optimallashtirilgan rasmlarga bu yangi tanlovni qo\'llash uchun %1$s yoki %2$s qiling.','Destroy All Optimization Data'=>'Barcha optimallashtirish ma\'lumotlarini yo\'q qilish','Soft Reset Optimization Counter'=>'Soft Reset optimizatsiya hisoblagichi','Automatically request optimization via cron job.'=>'Cron vazifasi orqali avtomatik ravishda optimallashtirishni so\'rash.','Optimize images and save backups of the originals in the same folder.'=>'Rasmlarni optimallashtiring va asl nusxalarining zaxira nusxalarini xuddi shu papkada saqlang.','Automatically remove the original image backups after fetching optimized images.'=>'Optimallashtirilgan rasmlarni olib kelgandan so\'ng asl rasm zaxira nusxalarini avtomatik ravishda olib tashlang.','This is irreversible.'=>'Bu amalni ortga qaytarib bo\'lmaydi.','You will be unable to Revert Optimization once the backups are deleted!'=>'Zaxiralar o\'chirilgandan so\'ng Optimallashtirishni bekor qilib bo\'lmaydi!','Optimize images using lossless compression.'=>'Yo\'qotishlarsiz siqish yordamida rasmlarni optimallashtiring.','This can improve quality but may result in larger images than lossy compression will.'=>'Bu sifatni yaxshilashi mumkin, ammo yo‘qotishli siqishdagiga qaraganda kattaroq rasmlarni keltirib chiqarishi mumkin.','No sizes found.'=>'Oʻlchamlar topilmadi.','Choose which image sizes to optimize.'=>'Qaysi rasm o\'lchamlarini optimallashtirishni tanlang.','Preserve EXIF data (copyright, GPS, comments, keywords, etc) when optimizing.'=>'Rasmlarni optimallashtirishda EXIF maʼlumotlarini (mualliflik huquqi, GPS, izohlar, kalit soʻzlar va hokazo) saqlab qoling.','This will increase the size of optimized files.'=>'Bu optimallashtirilgan fayllar hajmini oshiradi.','Specify which element attributes will be replaced with WebP/AVIF.'=>'Qaysi element atributlari WebP/AVIF bilan almashtirilishini ko\'rsating.','Enable replacement of WebP/AVIF in %s elements that were generated outside of WordPress logic.'=>'WordPress mantigidan tashqarida yaratilgan %s elementlarida WebP/AVIF almashtirilishini yoqish.','Current closest Cloud server is %s. Click to redetect.'=>'Joriy eng yaqin Bulut serveri: %s. Qaytadan aniqlash uchun bosing.','Are you sure you want to redetect the closest cloud server for this service?'=>'Ushbu xizmat uchun eng yaqin bulutli serverni qayta aniqlashni xohlaysizmi?','Redetect'=>'Qayta aniqlash','Image optimisation'=>'Tasvirni optimallashtirish','You can request a maximum of %s images at once.'=>'Siz bir vaxtning o\'zida ko\'pi bilan %s ta rasm so\'rashingiz mumkin.','To make sure our server can communicate with your server without any issues and everything works fine, for the few first requests the number of image groups allowed in a single request is limited.'=>'Serverimiz sizning serveringiz bilan hech qanday muammosiz muloqot qilishi va hamma narsa yaxshi ishlashini ta\'minlash uchun dastlabki bir nechta so\'rovlar uchun bitta so\'rovda ruxsat etilgan rasm guruhlari soni cheklangan.','Current limit is'=>'Joriy limit:','Send Optimization Request'=>'Optimizatsiya so\'rovini yuborish','Available after %d second(s)'=>'%d soniyadan keyin mavjud','Only press the button if the pull cron job is disabled.'=>'Faqatgina pull cron ishi o\'chirilgan bo\'lsagina tugmani bosing.','Images will be pulled automatically if the cron job is running.'=>'Agar kron vazifasi ishlayotgan bo\'lsa, rasmlar avtomatik ravishda yuklab olinadi.','Pull Images'=>'Obrazlarni tortib olish','Optimization Status'=>'Optimizatsiya holati','When the optimisation server finishes, it notifies your site to pull the optimised images.'=>'Optimizatsiya serveri ishni tugatgach, optimallashtirilgan rasmlarni tortib olish uchun saytingizga xabar beradi.','This process is automatic.'=>'Bu jarayon avtomatik.','Last pull initiated by cron at %s.'=>'Oxirgi marta %s da cron tomonidan boshlangan.','Storage Optimization'=>'Xotirani optimallashtirish','A backup of each image is saved before it is optimized.'=>'Har bir tasvirning zaxira nusxasi optimallashtirilishidan oldin saqlanadi.','Last calculated'=>'Oxirgi marta hisoblangan','Files'=>'Fayllar','Calculate Original Image Storage'=>'Asl rasm xotirasini hisoblash','Calculate Backups Disk Space'=>'Zaxira nusxalari disk hajmini hisoblash','Image Thumbnail Group Sizes'=>'Rasm miniatyurasi guruhining o\'lchamlari','Delete all backups of the original images'=>'Asl rasmlarning barcha zaxira nusxalarini o\'chirish','Last ran'=>'Oxirgi marta bajarilgan','Saved'=>'Saqlandi','Are you sure you want to remove all image backups?'=>'Barcha rasm zaxira nusxalarini oʻchirib tashlamoqchiligingizga aminmisiz?','Remove Original Image Backups'=>'Asl rasm zaxiralarini olib tashlash','Image Information'=>'Rasm haqida ma\'lumot','Image groups total'=>'Rasm guruhlari jami','Congratulations, all gathered!'=>'Tabriklaymiz, hammasi yig\'ildi!','What is a group?'=>'Guruh nima?','What is an image group?'=>'Tasvirlar guruhi nima?','Current image post id position'=>'Joriy rasm xabari identifikatori pozitsiyasi','Maximum image post id'=>'Maksimal rasm xabari identifikatori','Scan for any new unoptimized image thumbnail sizes and resend necessary image optimization requests.'=>'Har qanday yangi optimallashtirilmagan rasm eskizlari o\'lchamlarini skanerlang va kerakli rasm optimallashtirish so\'rovlarini qaytadan yuboring.','Rescan New Thumbnails'=>'Yangi eskizlarni qayta skanerlash','Optimization Summary'=>'Optimizatsiya xulosasi','Total Reduction'=>'Jami qisqartirish','Images Pulled'=>'Olingan obrazlar','Last Request'=>'Oxirgi soʻrov','Last Pulled'=>'Oxirgi tortib olingan','Results can be checked in %sMedia Library%s.'=>'Natijalarni %sMedia Kutubxona%s\'da tekshirish mumkin.','Optimization Tools'=>'Optimizatsiya vositalari','You can quickly switch between using original (unoptimized versions) and optimized image files. It will affect all images on your website, both regular and webp versions if available.'=>'Asl (optimizatsiya qilinmagan) va optimizatsiyalashtirilgan rasm fayllari o\'rtasida tezda o\'tishingiz mumkin. Bu veb-saytingizdagi barcha rasmlarga, jumladan, mavjud bo\'lsa, oddiy va webp versiyalariga ham ta\'sir qiladi.','Use original images (unoptimized) on your site'=>'Saytingizda asl rasmlardan (optimizatsiya qilinmagan) foydalaning','Use Original Files'=>'Asl fayllardan foydalanish','Switch back to using optimized images on your site'=>'Saytingizda optimallashtirilgan rasmlardan foydalanishga qayting','Use Optimized Files'=>'Optimizlashtirilgan fayllardan foydalanish','This will reset the %1$s. If you changed WebP/AVIF settings and want to generate %2$s for the previously optimized images, use this action.'=>'Bu %1$s ni asl holatiga qaytaradi. Agar siz WebP/AVIF sozlamalarini o\'zgartirgan bo\'lsangiz va oldindan optimallashtirilgan rasmlar uchun %2$s yaratmoqchi bo\'lsangiz, ushbu amalni bajaring.','Are you sure to destroy all optimized images?'=>'Barcha optimallashtirilgan rasmlarni oʻchirib yubormoqchimisiz?','Remove all previous image optimization requests/results, revert completed optimizations, and delete all optimization files.'=>'Oldingi barcha tasvirni optimallashtirish soʻrovlari/natijalarini olib tashlang, yakunlangan optimallashtirishlarni bekor qiling va barcha optimallashtirish fayllarini oʻchirib tashlang.','Read the upstream Zinn® Cache Engine documentation'=>'Yuqoridagi Zinn® kesh mexanizmi hujjatlarini o‘qing','Zinn Digital® support'=>'Zinn Digital® qo\'llab-quvvatlash','Zinn® Cache Engine user guide'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine foydalanuvchi qo\'llanmasi','To use the caching functions you must have a LiteSpeed or OpenLiteSpeed web server with the LSCache module.'=>'Keshniplash funksiyalaridan foydalanish uchun sizda LSCache moduli bilan birga LiteSpeed yoki OpenLiteSpeed veb-serveri bo\'lishi kerak.','Please enable the LSCache Module at the server level, or ask your hosting provider.'=>'Iltimos, LSCache modulini server darajasida yoqing yoki hosting provayderingizdan so\'rang.','Please enable Zinn® Cache Engine in the plugin settings.'=>'Iltimos, plagin sozlamalarida Zinn® Cache Engineʼni yoqing.','LSCache caching functions on this page are currently unavailable!'=>'Ushbu sahifadagi LSCache keshlash funksiyalari hozircha mavjud emas!','The network admin selected use primary site configs for all subsites.'=>'Tarmoq administratori barcha quyi saytlar uchun asosiy sayt konfiguratsiyalaridan foydalanishni tanladi.','The following options are selected, but are not editable in this settings page.'=>'Quyidagi parametrlar tanlangan, biroq ularni ushbu sozlamalar sahifasida tahrirlab boʻlmaydi.','LiteSpeed cache plugin upgraded. Please refresh the page to complete the configuration data upgrade.'=>'LiteSpeed kesh plagini yangilandi. Konfiguratsiya ma\'lumotlarini yangilashni yakunlash uchun sahifani yangilang.','Deactivate Zinn® Cache Engine'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine\'ni o\'chirish','The deactivation is temporary'=>'Deaktivatsiya vaqtincha','Site performance is worse'=>'Sayt unumdorligi yomonroq','Plugin is too complicated'=>'Plagin juda murakkab','Other'=>'Boshqa','Why are you deactivating the plugin?'=>'Nima uchun plaginni o\'chirib qo\'ymoqdasiz?','On uninstall, all plugin settings will be deleted.'=>'Oʻchirilganda, barcha plagin sozlamalari oʻchirib yuboriladi.','If you have used Image Optimization, please %sDestroy All Optimization Data%s first. NOTE: this does not remove your optimized images.'=>'Agar siz Rasm optimizatsiyasidan foydalangan bo\'lsangiz, avval %sBarcha optimizatsiya ma\'lumotlarini yo\'q qilish%s tugmasini bosing. ESLATMA: bu optimallashtirilgan rasmlaringizni o\'chirib yubormaydi.','Deactivate'=>'Faollashtirmaslik','Deactivate plugin'=>'Plaginni faolsizlantirish','Close popup'=>'Oynani yopish','Zinn® Cache Engine plugin is installed!'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine plagini oʻrnatildi!','This message indicates that the plugin was installed by the server admin.'=>'Bu xabar plagin server administratori tomonidan o\'rnatilganligini bildiradi.','The Zinn® Cache Engine plugin is used to cache pages - a simple way to improve the performance of the site.'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine plagini sahifalarni kesh qilish uchun ishlatiladi — bu sayt unumdorligini oshirishning oddiy usuli.','However, there is no way of knowing all the possible customizations that were implemented.'=>'Biroq, amalga oshirilgan barcha mumkin bo\'lgan moslashtirishlarni bilishning iloji yo\'q.','For that reason, please test the site to make sure everything still functions properly.'=>'Shu sababli, hamma narsa toʻgʻri ishlashiga ishonch hosil qilish uchun iltimos, saytni sinab koʻring.','Examples of test cases include:'=>'Test holatlariga misollar quyidagilarni o\'z ichiga oladi:','Visit the site while logged out.'=>'Tizimdan chiqqan holda saytga tashrif buyuring.','Create a post, make sure the front page is accurate.'=>'Post yarating, bosh sahifa to‘g‘riligiga ishonch hosil qiling.','If there are any questions, the team is always happy to answer any questions on the %ssupport forum%s.'=>'Agar qandaydir savollar tug‘ilsa, jamoa %ssupport forum%sidagi istalgan savolga javob berishdan doimo mamnun.','If you would rather not move at litespeed, you can deactivate this plugin.'=>'Agar litespeed bo\'yicha harakat qilishni istamasangiz, ushbu plaginni o\'chirib qo\'yishingiz mumkin.','NOTICE: Database login cookie did not match your login cookie.'=>'DIQQAT: Ma\'lumotlar bazasiga kirish kuki fayli sizning kirish kuki faylingizga mos kelmadi.','If the login cookie was recently changed in the settings, please log out and back in.'=>'Agar tizimga kirish uchun cookie-fayl sozlamalarda yaqinda o\'zgartirilgan bo\'lsa, iltimos, tizimdan chiqib, qaytadan kiring.','If not, please verify the setting in the %sAdvanced tab%s.'=>'Agar yo\'q bo\'lsa, iltimos, %sAdvanced tab%s\'dagi sozlamani tekshiring.','If using OpenLiteSpeed, the server must be restarted once for the changes to take effect.'=>'Agar OpenLiteSpeed ishlatilayotgan bo\'lsa, o\'zgarishlar kuchga kirishi uchun serverni bir marta qayta ishga tushirish kerak.','Unexpected cache rule %2$s found in %1$s file. This rule may cause visitors to see old versions of pages due to the browser caching HTML pages. If you are sure that HTML pages are not being browser cached, this message can be dismissed. (%3$sLearn More%4$s)'=>'%1$s faylida kutilmagan kesh qoidasi %2$s topildi. Ushbu qoida brauzer HTML sahifalarini kesh qilishi sababli tashrif buyuruvchilarga sahifalarning eski versiyalarini ko‘rsatishiga olib kelishi mumkin. Agar HTML sahifalar brauzerda keshlanmayotganiga amin bo‘lsangiz, bu xabarni yopishingiz mumkin. (%3$sBatafsil%4$s)','OptimaX Summary'=>'OptimaX xulosasi','OptimaX Settings'=>'OptimaX sozlamalari','Zinn® Cache Engine OptimaX'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine OptimaX','Turn on OptimaX. This will automatically request your pages OptimaX result via cron job.'=>'OptimaX ni yoqing. Bu cron vazifasi orqali sahifalaringizning OptimaX natijasini avtomatik ravishda so\'raydi.','CSS Settings'=>'CSS Sozlamalari','JS Settings'=>'JS sozlamalari','HTML Settings'=>'HTML sozlamalari','Media Settings'=>'Media sozlamalari','VPI'=>'VPI','Media Excludes'=>'Media istisnolari','Localization'=>'Mahalliylashtirish','Tuning'=>'Sozlash','Zinn® Cache Engine Page Optimization'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine Sahifani Optimallashtirish','Please test thoroughly when enabling any option in this list. After changing Minify/Combine settings, please do a Purge All action.'=>'Ushbu roʻyxatdagi har qanday funksiyani yoqishdan oldin uni yaxshilab sinab koʻring. Minify/Combine (Kichraytirish/Birlashtirish) sozlamalarini oʻzgartirgandan soʻng, Purge All (Barchasini tozalash) amalini bajaring.','Minify CSS files and inline CSS code.'=>'CSS fayllarini kichraytirish va CSS kodini matn ichiga joylashtirish.','Combine CSS files and inline CSS code.'=>'CSS fayllari va qator ichidagi (inline) CSS kodini birlashtirish.','How to Fix Problems Caused by CSS/JS Optimization.'=>'CSS/JS optimizatsiyasi keltirib chiqargan muammolarni qanday hal qilish mumkin.','Generate unique CSS through an online generation service.'=>'Onlayn generatsiya xizmati orqali noyob CSS yarating.','This will drop the unused CSS on each page from the combined file.'=>'Bu birlashtirilgan fayldan har bir sahifadagi ishlatilmagan CSS\'ni olib tashlaydi.','Automatic generation of unique CSS is in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'Noyob CSS\'ni avtomatik generatsiya qilish cron\'ga asoslangan navbat orqali fonda amalga oshiriladi.','Filter %s available for UCSS per page type generation.'=>'Sahifa turi boʻyicha UCSS generatsiyasi uchun %s filtri mavjud.','This option is bypassed because %1$s option is %2$s.'=>'Ushbu parametr chetlab o\'tildi, chunki %1$s parametri %2$s.','Last generated'=>'Oxirgi marta yaratilgan','Last requested cost'=>'Oxirgi so\'ralgan xarajat','URL list in %s queue waiting for cron'=>'cron ni kutayotgan %s navbatidagi URL manzillar ro‘yxati','Clear'=>'Tozalash','Run %s Queue Manually'=>'%s navbatini qo\'lda ishga tushirish','Inline UCSS to reduce the extra CSS file loading. This option will not be automatically turned on for %1$s pages. To use it on %1$s pages, please set it to ON.'=>'Qo‘shimcha CSS faylini yuklashni kamaytirish uchun UCSS\'ni ichki (inline) tarzda joylashtiring. Ushbu parametr %1$s sahifalar uchun avtomatik ravishda yoqilmaydi. Uni %1$s sahifalarda ishlatish uchun Yoqilgan holatiga o‘rnating.','This option will automatically bypass %s option.'=>'Bu parametr avtomatik ravishda %s parametrini chetlab o\'tadi.','Include external CSS and inline CSS in combined file when %1$s is also enabled. This option helps maintain the priorities of CSS, which should minimize potential errors caused by CSS Combine.'=>'%1$s ham yoqilgan bo\'lganda tashqi CSS va inline CSS\'ni birlashtirilgan faylga kiriting. Ushbu parametr CSS ustuvorliklarini saqlashga yordam beradi, bu esa CSS Combine tufayli yuzaga kelishi mumkin bo\'lgan xatolarni kamaytirishi kerak.','Optimize CSS delivery.'=>'CSS yetkazib berishni optimallashtirish.','This can improve your speed score in services like Pingdom, GTmetrix and PageSpeed.'=>'Bu Pingdom, GTmetrix va PageSpeed kabi xizmatlardagi tezlik ko\'rsatkichi darajasini yaxshilashi mumkin.','Generate critical CSS through an online generation service and load the remaining CSS asynchronously.'=>'Kritik CSS\'ni onlayn generatsiya xizmati orqali yarating va qolgan CSS\'ni asinxron tarzda yuklang.','Automatic generation of critical CSS is in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'Kritik CSS-ni avtomatik yaratish cron asosidagi navbat orqali fonda amalga oshirilmoqda.','When this option is turned %s, it will also load Google Fonts asynchronously.'=>'Ushbu parametr %s holatiga o\'tkazilganda, u shuningdek Google Fonts shriftlarini asinxron tarzda yuklaydi.','Elements with attribute %s in HTML code will be excluded.'=>'HTML kodida %s atributiga ega elementlar chiqarib tashlanadi.','This option is bypassed due to %s option.'=>'Bu parametr %s parametri tufayli chetlab o\'tildi.','Disable this option to generate CCSS per Post Type instead of per page. This can save significant CCSS quota, however it may result in incorrect CSS styling if your site uses a page builder.'=>'Har bir sahifa o‘rniga har bir post turi uchun CCSS yaratish uchun ushbu opsiyani o‘chirib qo‘ying. Bu CCSS kvotasini sezilarli darajada tejashi mumkin, biroq saytingiz sahifa konstruktoridan foydalansa, CSS uslublarining noto‘g‘ri chiqishiga olib kelishi mumkin.','This will inline the asynchronous CSS library to avoid render blocking.'=>'Bu render bloklanishining oldini olish uchun asinxron CSS kutubxonasini inlayn qiladi.','Default'=>'Standart','Set this to append %1$s to all %2$s rules before caching CSS to specify how fonts should be displayed while being downloaded.'=>'Shriftlar yuklab olinayotganda qanday koʻrsatilishi kerakligini belgilash uchun CSS keshlanishidan oldin barcha %2$s qoidalariga %1$s qoʻshish uchun buni oʻrnating.','%s is recommended.'=>'%s tavsiya etiladi.','Swap'=>'Almashtirish','Minify HTML content.'=>'HTML kontentini kichraytirish.','Prefetching DNS can reduce latency for visitors.'=>'DNS\'ni oldindan yuklash tashrif buyuruvchilar uchun kechikishni kamaytirishi mumkin.','For example'=>'Masalan','Automatically enable DNS prefetching for all URLs in the document, including images, CSS, JavaScript, and so forth.'=>'Hujjatdagi barcha havolalar, jumladan rasmlar, CSS, JavaScript va hokazolar uchun DNS oldindan olishni avtomatik ravishda yoqish.','This can improve the page loading speed.'=>'Bu sahifaning yuklanish tezligini yaxshilashi mumkin.','Preconnecting speeds up future loads from a given origin.'=>'Oldindan ulanish ma\'lum bir manbadan kelgusidagi yuklanishlarni tezlashtiradi.','Delay rendering off-screen HTML elements by its selector.'=>'Ekrandan tashqaridagi HTML elementlarini selektori bo\'yicha render qilishni kechiktirish.','When minifying HTML do not discard comments that match a specified pattern.'=>'HTML\'ni kichraytirishda belgilangan qoidaga mos keladigan izohlarni olib tashlamang.','If comment to be kept is like: %1$s write: %2$s'=>'Agar saqlanishi kerak bo\'lgan izoh quyidagicha bo\'lsa: %1$s yozing: %2$s','Remove query strings from internal static resources.'=>'Ichki statik resurslardan so\'rov qatorlarini olib tashlang.','Google reCAPTCHA will be bypassed automatically.'=>'Google reCAPTCHA avtomatik ravishda chetlab o‘tiladi.','Append query string %s to the resources to bypass this action.'=>'Ushbu amalni chetlab o\'tish uchun resurslarga %s so\'rov qatorini qo\'shing.','Use Web Font Loader library to load Google Fonts asynchronously while leaving other CSS intact.'=>'Boshqa CSS’ni o‘z holida qoldirgan holda, Google Fonts shriftlarini asinxron yuklash uchun Web Font Loader kutubxonasidan foydalaning.','This will also add a preconnect to Google Fonts to establish a connection earlier.'=>'Bu shuningdek, ulanishni ertaroq o‘rnatish uchun Google Fonts\'ga preconnect qo‘shadi.','Prevent Google Fonts from loading on all pages.'=>'Google shriftlarining barcha sahifalarda yuklanishining oldini olish.','Stop loading WordPress.org emoji. Browser default emoji will be displayed instead.'=>'WordPress.org emojilarini yuklashni to\'xtating. Buning o\'rniga brauzerning standart emojilari ko\'rsatiladi.','This option will remove all %s tags from HTML.'=>'Bu parametr HTML’dan barcha %s teglarini olib tashlaydi.','Minify JS files and inline JS codes.'=>'JS fayllarini minifikatsiya qiling va JS kodlarini sahifaga inlayn qiling.','Combine all local JS files into a single file.'=>'Barcha mahalliy JS fayllarini bitta faylga birlashtiring.','This option may result in a JS error or layout issue on frontend pages with certain themes/plugins.'=>'Ushbu parametr ayrim mavzular/plaginlarga ega old qism sahifalarida JS xatosiga yoki maket muammosiga olib kelishi mumkin.','JS error can be found from the developer console of browser by right clicking and choosing Inspect.'=>'JS xatoligini sichqonchaning o‘ng tugmasini bosib, "Tekshirish" (Inspect) bandini tanlash orqali brauzerning dasturchi konsolidan topish mumkin.','Include external JS and inline JS in combined file when %1$s is also enabled. This option helps maintain the priorities of JS execution, which should minimize potential errors caused by JS Combine.'=>'%1$s ham yoqilganda, tashqi JS va ichki JS\'ni birlashtirilgan faylga kiriting. Ushbu parametr JS Combine tufayli yuzaga kelishi mumkin bo\'lgan xatolarni kamaytirishga yordam beradigan JS bajarilish ustuvorliklarini saqlashga yordam beradi.','Deferred'=>'Keyinga qoldirilgan','Delayed'=>'Kechiktirilgan','Deferring until page is parsed or delaying till interaction can help reduce resource contention and improve performance causing a lower FID (Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'Sahifa tahlil qilinguncha kechiktirish yoki o\'zaro ta\'sirga qadar kechiktirish resurslar raqobatini kamaytirishga va ishlashni yaxshilashga yordam beradi, bu esa pastroq FID (Core Web Vitals metriklari) kelib chiqishiga olib keladi.','Failed to create Avatar table. Please follow <a %s>Table Creation guidance from LiteSpeed Wiki</a> to finish setup.'=>'Avatar jadvalini yaratib bo\'lmadi. Sozlashni yakunlash uchun <a %s>LiteSpeed Wiki jadval yaratish qo\'llanmasi</a>ga amal qiling.','Localization Settings'=>'Mahalliylashtirish sozlamalari','Store Gravatar locally.'=>'Gravatar\'ni mahalliy tarzda saqlash.','Accelerates the speed by caching Gravatar (Globally Recognized Avatars).'=>'Gravatar (Globally Recognized Avatars) ni keshlash orqali tezlikni oshiradi.','Refresh Gravatar cache by cron.'=>'Kron orqali Gravatar keshini yangilash.','Avatar list in queue waiting for update'=>'Yangilanishni kutish navbatidagi avatarlar ro‘yxati','Run Queue Manually'=>'Navbatni qo\'lda ishga tushirish','Specify how long, in seconds, Gravatar files are cached.'=>'Gravatar fayllari qancha vaqt, soniyalarda keshlanishini ko\'rsating.','Localize external resources.'=>'Tashqi resurslarni mahalliylashtirish.','Please thoroughly test all items in %s to ensure they function as expected.'=>'Iltimos, %s dagi barcha elementlar kutilgandek ishlashini ta\'minlash uchun ularni sinchkovlik bilan sinovdan o\'tkazing.','Resources listed here will be copied and replaced with local URLs.'=>'Bu yerda ko\'rsatilgan resurslar nusxalanadi va mahalliy URL manzillari bilan almashtiriladi.','HTTPS sources only.'=>'Faqat HTTPS manbalari.','Comments are supported. Start a line with a %s to turn it into a comment line.'=>'Izohlar qo\'llab-quvvatlanadi. Qatorni izoh qatoriga aylantirish uchun uni %s bilan boshlang.','Example'=>'Misol','Please thoroughly test each JS file you add to ensure it functions as expected.'=>'Iltimos, kutilgandek ishlashini ta\'minlash uchun qo\'shgan har bir JS faylingizni yaxshilab sinovdan o\'tkazing.','Load images only when they enter the viewport.'=>'Faqat ko‘rish maydoniga kirgandagina rasmlarni yuklash.','This can improve page loading time by reducing initial HTTP requests.'=>'Bu boshlangʻich HTTP soʻrovlarini kamaytirish orqali sahifaning yuklanish vaqtini yaxshilashi mumkin.','Adding Style to Your Lazy-Loaded Images'=>'Lazy-Loaded Rasmlarga Stil Qo\'shish','Specify a base64 image to be used as a simple placeholder while images finish loading.'=>'Rasmlar yuklanib bo\'lguncha oddiy to\'ldiruvchi sifatida ishlatiladigan base64 formatidagi rasmni ko\'rsating.','This can be predefined in %2$s as well using constant %1$s, with this setting taking priority.'=>'Bu sozlama ustunlikka ega bo\'lgan holda, %1$s konstantasidan foydalangan holda %2$s da ham oldindan belgilanishi mumkin.','By default a gray image placeholder %s will be used.'=>'Odatiy bo\'yicha kulrang rasm to\'ldiruvchisi %s ishlatiladi.','For example, %s can be used for a transparent placeholder.'=>'Masalan, shaffof to‘ldiruvchi belgi uchun %s ishlatilishi mumkin.','Responsive image placeholders can help to reduce layout reshuffle when images are loaded.'=>'Moslashuvchan rasm to‘ldirgichlari rasmlar yuklanayotganda sahifa tartibining o‘zgarishini kamaytirishga yordam beradi.','This will generate the placeholder with same dimensions as the image if it has the width and height attributes.'=>'Agar rasmda kenglik va balandlik atributlari mavjud bo\'lsa, bu uning o\'lchamlari bilan bir xil bo\'lgan joy egasini (placeholder) hosil qiladi.','Specify an SVG to be used as a placeholder when generating locally.'=>'Mahalliy miqyosda yaratishda to‘ldiruvchi (placeholder) sifatida ishlatiladigan SVG ni ko‘rsating.','It will be converted to a base64 SVG placeholder on-the-fly.'=>'U bazaviy 64 formatdagi SVG to\'ldiruvchisiga darhol aylantiriladi.','Variables %s will be replaced with the corresponding image properties.'=>'%s o\'zgaruvchilari tegishli tasvir xususiyatlari bilan almashtiriladi.','Variables %s will be replaced with the configured background color.'=>'%s o\'zgaruvchilari sozlangan fon rangi bilan almashtiriladi.','Specify the responsive placeholder SVG color.'=>'Moslashuvchan joy egasi SVG rangini belgilang.','Generate Low Quality Image Placeholders through an online generation service, for responsive image previews while loading.'=>'Yuklanayotgan paytda moslashuvchan rasm ko‘rinishlari uchun onlayn generatsiya xizmati orqali past sifatli rasm joy egallovchilarini yarating.','Keep this off to use plain color placeholders.'=>'Oddiy rangli to\'ldirgichlardan foydalanish uchun buni o\'chirib qo\'ying.','Specify the quality when generating LQIP.'=>'LQIP yaratishda sifatni ko\'rsating.','Larger number will generate higher resolution quality placeholder, but will result in larger files which will increase page size and consume more points.'=>'Kattaroq raqam yuqori piksellar sifatidagi joy egallovchini hosil qiladi, biroq bu sahifa hajmini oshiradigan va ko‘proq ball iste\'mol qiladigan kattaroq fayllarga olib keladi.','Changes to this setting do not apply to already-generated LQIPs. To regenerate existing LQIPs, please %s first from the admin bar menu.'=>'Bu sozlamaga kiritilgan oʻzgarishlar allaqachon yaratilgan LQIP\'larga taalluqli emas. Mavjud LQIP\'larni qayta yaratish uchun, iltimos, avval admin paneli menyusidan %s.','pixels'=>'piksellar','LQIP requests will not be sent for images where both width and height are smaller than these dimensions.'=>'Kengligi va balandligi ushbu o\'lchamlardan kichik bo\'lgan rasmlar uchun LQIP so\'rovlari yuborilmaydi.','Automatically generate LQIP in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'Cron asosidagi navbat orqali fonda LQIP ni avtomatik ravishda yarating.','If set to %1$s, before the placeholder is localized, the %2$s configuration will be used.'=>'%1$s qilib sobit qilinganda, joy egasi mahalliylashtirilgunga qadar %2$s konfiguratsiyasi ishlatiladi.','If set to %s this is done in the foreground, which may slow down page load.'=>'Agar %s qilib belgilansa, bu oldingi planda bajariladi, bu esa sahifaning yuklanishini sekinlashtirishi mumkin.','Size list in queue waiting for cron'=>'Cron\'ni kutish navbatidagi ro\'yxat hajmi','Load iframes only when they enter the viewport.'=>'Iframe\'larni faqat ko‘rish maydoniga (viewport) kirganda yuklash.','Set an explicit width and height on image elements to reduce layout shifts and improve CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'Maket siljishlarini kamaytirish va CLS (Core Web Vitals ko‘rsatkichi)ni yaxshilash uchun rasm elementlariga aniq kenglik va balandlik o‘rnating.','Use %1$s to bypass remote image dimension check when %2$s is ON.'=>'%2$s yoqilgan bo\'lganda masofaviy rasm o\'lchamini tekshirishni chetlab o\'tish uchun %1$s dan foydalaning.','The image compression quality setting of WordPress out of 100.'=>'WordPress ning 100 dan tasvirni siqish sifati sozlamasi.','Automatically replace large images with scaled versions.'=>'Katta rasmlarni avtomatik ravishda oʻlchami kichraytirilgan versiyalar bilan almashtiring.','Scaled size threshold'=>'Masshtablangan hajm chegarasi','Filter %s available to change threshold.'=>'Chegarani oʻzgartirish uchun %s filtri mavjud.','Listed images will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Ro‘yxatga kiritilgan rasmlar kechiktirib yuklanmaydi.','Useful for above-the-fold images causing CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'CLS ga (Core Web Vitals metrikasi) sabab bo\'ladigan sahifaning yuqori qismidagi (above-the-fold) rasmlar uchun foydali.','Elements with attribute %s in html code will be excluded.'=>'html kodida %s atributiga ega elementlar chiqarib tashlanadi.','Images containing these class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Ushbu sinf nomlarini o\'z ichiga olgan rasmlar kechiktirib yuklanmaydi.','Images having these parent class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Ushbu ota sinf nomlariga ega rasmlar sekin yuklanmaydi.','Iframes containing these class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Ushbu sinf nomlarini o\'z ichiga olgan iframe\'lar kechiktirib yuklanmaydi.','Iframes having these parent class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Ushbu ota sinf nomlariga ega iframe\'lar kechiktirib yuklanmaydi.','Prevent any lazy load of listed pages.'=>'Ko\'rsatilgan sahifalarning har qanday kechiktirilgan yuklanishini oldini oling.','These images will not generate LQIP.'=>'Bu rasmlar uchun LQIP yaratilmaydi.','Tuning Settings'=>'Sozlamalarni sozlash','Listed JS files or inline JS code will be delayed.'=>'Ko\'rsatilgan JS fayllari yoki inline JS kodi kechiktiriladi.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be minified or combined.'=>'Ro‘yxatga olingan JS fayllari yoki ichki JS kodi kichraytirilmaydi yoki birlashtirilmaydi.','Predefined list will also be combined with the above settings.'=>'Oldindan belgilangan roʻyxat yuqoridagi parametrlar bilan ham birlashtiriladi.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be deferred or delayed.'=>'Roʻyxatga olingan JS fayllari yoki inline JS kodi kechiktirilmaydi yoki orqaga surilmaydi.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be optimized by %s.'=>'Ko\'rsatilgan JS fayllari yoki inline JS kodi %s tomonidan optimizatsiya qilinmaydi.','Prevent any optimization of listed pages.'=>'Ko‘rsatilgan sahifalarning har qanday optimizatsiyasini oldini oling.','Only optimize pages for guest (not logged in) visitors. If turned this OFF, CSS/JS/CCSS files will be doubled by each user group.'=>'Faqat mehmon (tizimga kirmagan) tashrif buyuruvchilar uchun sahifalarni optimallashtiring. Agar bu O‘CHIRILSA, CSS/JS/CCSS fayllari har bir foydalanuvchi guruhi tomonidan ikki baravar ko‘paytiriladi.','Selected roles will be excluded from all optimizations.'=>'Tanlangan rollar barcha optimallashtirishlardan chiqarib tashlanadi.','Tuning CSS Settings'=>'CSS Sozlamalarini Sozlash','Listed CSS files or inline CSS code will not be minified or combined.'=>'Roʻyxatga kiritilgan CSS fayllari yoki toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri kiritilgan CSS kodi kichraytirilmaydi yoki birlashtirilmaydi.','Predefined list will also be combined with the above settings'=>'Oldindan belgilangan roʻyxat yuqoridagi parametrlar bilan ham birlashtiriladi','Listed CSS files will be excluded from UCSS and saved to inline.'=>'Ro\'yxatga kiritilgan CSS fayllari UCSS\'dan chiqarib tashlanadi va inline\'ga saqlanadi.','List the CSS selectors whose styles should always be included in UCSS.'=>'CSS uslublari har doim UCSS\'ga kiritilishi kerak bo\'lgan CSS selektorlarini ro\'yxatlang.','Learn more'=>'Batafsil ma\'lumot','Wildcard %s supported.'=>'Wildcard %s qo‘llab-quvvatlanadi.','The selector must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'Tanlovchi CSS-da mavjud bo\'lishi kerak. HTML-dagi ota-ona sinflari ishlamaydi.','Listed URI will not generate UCSS.'=>'Ko\'rsatilgan URI UCSS hosil qilmaydi.','Use %1$s to generate one single UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s while other page types still per URL.'=>'Boshqa sahifa turlari har bir URL uchun ishlashda davom etgan holda, sahifa turi %2$s bo\'lgan sahifalar uchun yagona UCSS generatsiya qilish uchun %1$s dan foydalaning.','Use %1$s to bypass UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s.'=>'Sahifa turi %2$s boʻlgan sahifalar uchun UCSSʼni chetlab oʻtish uchun %1$sʼdan foydalaning.','List post types where each item of that type should have its own CCSS generated.'=>'Har bir element uchun o\'zining CCSS yaratilishi kerak bo\'lgan post turlarini ro\'yxatlang.','For example, if every Page on the site has different formatting, enter %s in the box. Separate critical CSS files will be stored for every Page on the site.'=>'Masalan, agar saytdagi har bir Sahifa turlicha formatlashga ega bo\'lsa, katakchaga %s kiriting. Saytdagi har bir Sahifa uchun alohida muhim CSS fayllari saqlanadi.','Separate critical CSS files will be generated for paths containing these strings.'=>'Ushbu qatorlarni o\'z ichiga olgan yo\'llar uchun alohida muhim CSS fayllari yaratiladi.','List the CSS selectors whose styles should always be included in CCSS.'=>'CCSS\'ga uslublari doimiy ravishda kiritilishi kerak bo\'lgan CSS selektorlarini ro\'yxatga kiriting.','Selectors must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'Selektorlar CSS da mavjud bo\'lishi kerak. HTML dagi ota-ona klasslari ishlamaydi.','Specify critical CSS rules for above-the-fold content when enabling %s.'=>'%s ni yoqishda ekranning yuqori qismidagi kontent uchun muhim CSS qoidalarini ko\'rsating.','When you use Lazy Load, it will delay the loading of all images on a page.'=>'Lazy Load\'dan foydalanganingizda, u sahifadagi barcha rasmlarning yuklanishini kechiktiradi.','The Viewport Images service detects which images appear above the fold, and excludes them from lazy load.'=>'Viewport Images xizmati ekranning yuqori qismida koʻrinadigan tasvirlarni aniqlaydi va ularni kechiktirilgan yuklashdan (lazy load) chiqarib tashlaydi.','This enables the page\'s initial screenful of imagery to be fully displayed without delay.'=>'Bu sahifaning dastlabki ekranidagi tasvirlarning kechiktirmasdan to\'liq namoyish etilishini ta\'minlaydi.','Enable Viewport Images auto generation cron.'=>'Viewport tasvirlarini avtomatik yaratish cron\'ini yoqish.','Standard Presets'=>'Standart shablonlar','Import / Export'=>'Import / Eksport','Zinn® Cache Engine Configuration Presets'=>'Zinn® Kesh mexanizmi konfiguratsiya shablonlari','Essentials'=>'Asosiy xususiyatlar','Default Cache'=>'Standart kesh','Higher TTL'=>'Yuqori TTL','This no-risk preset is appropriate for all websites. Good for new users, simple websites, or cache-oriented development.'=>'Bu xavf-xatarsiz sozlama barcha veb-saytlar uchun mos keladi. Yangi foydalanuvchilar, oddiy veb-saytlar yoki keshga yo\'naltirilgan dasturlash uchun yaxshi.','Only basic caching features are enabled. Every option in this preset works without any online service.'=>'Faqat asosiy kesh xususiyatlari yoqilgan. Ushbu sozlamadagi har bir parametr har qanday onlayn xizmatisiz ishlaydi.','Basic'=>'Asosiy','Everything in Essentials, Plus'=>'Essentials\'dagi hamma narsa, Plus','Mobile Cache'=>'Mobil kesh','This low-risk preset introduces basic optimizations for speed and user experience. Appropriate for enthusiastic beginners.'=>'Ushbu xavfi past sozlama tezlik va foydalanuvchi tajribasi uchun asosiy optimallashtirishlarni taqdim etadi. Havaskor yangi boshlovchilar uchun mos keladi.','Includes optimizations known to improve site score in page speed measurement tools. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'Sahifa tezligini oʻlchash vositalarida sayt koʻrsatkichlarini yaxshilashi maʼlum boʻlgan optimallashtirishlarni oʻz ichiga oladi. Ulardan baʼzilari ushbu plaginga kiritilmagan onlayn generatsiya xizmatini talab qiladi va shuning uchun ular taʼsir koʻrsatmaydi.','Advanced (Recommended)'=>'Kengaytirilgan (Tavsiya etiladi)','Everything in Basic, Plus'=>'Basic, Plus tarzidagi barcha narsalar','Guest Mode and Guest Optimization'=>'Mehmon rejimi va mehmon optimizatsiyasi','CSS, JS and HTML Minification'=>'CSS, JS va HTML Minifikatsiyasi','JS Defer for both external and inline JS'=>'Tashqi va ichki JS uchun JS Defer','DNS Prefetch for static files'=>'Statik fayllar uchun DNS Prefetch','Remove Query Strings from Static Files'=>'Statik fayllardan so\'rov qatorlarini olib tashlash','This preset is good for most websites, and is unlikely to cause conflicts. Any CSS or JS conflicts may be resolved with Page Optimization > Tuning tools.'=>'Bu shablon aksariyat veb-saytlar uchun mos keladi va ziddiyatlarni keltirib chiqarishi dargumon. Har qanday CSS yoki JS ziddiyatlarini Sahifani optimallashtirish > Sozlash vositalari yordamida hal qilish mumkin.','Includes many optimizations known to improve page speed scores. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'Sahifa tezligi ballarini yaxshilashi ma\'lum bo\'lgan ko\'plab optimallashtirishlarni o\'z ichiga oladi. Ularning ba\'zilari ushbu plginga kiritilmagan onlayn generatsiya xizmatini talab qiladi va shuning uchun ular ta\'sir ko\'rsatmaydi.','Aggressive'=>'O\'ta faol','Everything in Advanced, Plus'=>'Advanced va Plus tarfigidagi barcha narsalar','CSS & JS Combine'=>'CSS va JS\'ni birlashtirish','Asynchronous CSS Loading with Critical CSS'=>'Kritik CSS bilan asinxron CSS yuklash','Removed Unused CSS for Users'=>'Foydalanuvchilar uchun foydalanilmagan CSS olib tashlandi','Lazy Load for Iframes'=>'Ifeymlar uchun yalqov yuklash','This preset might work out of the box for some websites, but be sure to test! Some CSS or JS exclusions may be necessary in Page Optimization > Tuning.'=>'Bu sozlama ba\'zi veb-saytlar uchun darhol ishlayishi mumkin, lekin albatta sinab ko\'ring! Sahifani optimallashtirish > Sozlash bo\'limida ba\'zi CSS yoki JS istisnolari talab qilinishi mumkin.','Extreme'=>'O‘ta yuqori','Everything in Aggressive, Plus'=>'Aggressive tarifidagi barcha narsalar, ustiga yana','Lazy Load for Images'=>'Rasmlarni kech yuklash','Viewport Image Generation'=>'Ko\'rish maydoni tasvirini yaratish','JS Delayed'=>'JS kechiktirildi','Inline JS added to Combine'=>'Qo\'shishga qo\'shilgan Inline JS','Inline CSS added to Combine'=>'Kombinatsiyaga qo\'shilgan inline CSS','This preset almost certainly will require testing and exclusions for some CSS, JS and Lazy Loaded images. Pay special attention to logos, or HTML-based slider images.'=>'Bu sozlama deyarli aniq ba\'zi CSS, JS va Lazy Loaded (kech yuklanadigan) rasmlar uchun sinov va istisnolarni talab qiladi. Logotiplar yoki HTML asosidagi slayd rasmlariga alohida e\'tibor bering.','Enables the maximum level of optimizations for improved page speed scores. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'Sahifa tezligi ko\'rsatkichlarini yaxshilash uchun optimallashtirishning maksimal darajasini faollashtiradi. Ulardan ba\'zilari ushbu plginga kiritilmagan onlayn generatsiya xizmatini talab qiladi va shuning uchun ular ta\'sir ko\'rsatmaydi.','Zinn® Cache Engine Standard Presets'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine standart sozlamalari','Use an official LiteSpeed-designed Preset to configure your site in one click. Try no-risk caching essentials, extreme optimization, or something in between.'=>'Saytingizni bir bosish bilan sozlash uchun LiteSpeed tomonidan maxsus ishlab chiqilgan rasmiy tayyor sozlamadan foydalaning. Tavakkalsiz keshlovchi asosiy vositalar, o‘ta yuqori darajadagi optimallashtirish yoki ular orasidagi boshqa variantni sinab ko‘ring.','Who should use this preset?'=>'Bu moslamadan kimlar foydalanishi kerak?','This will back up your current settings and replace them with the %1$s preset settings. Do you want to continue?'=>'Bu joriy sozlamalaringizni zaxiralaydi va ularni %1$s oldindan belgilangan sozlamalari bilan almashtiradi. Davom etishni xohlaysizmi?','Apply Preset'=>'Andozani qo\'llash','unknown'=>'noma\'lum','History'=>'Tarix','Error: Failed to apply the settings %1$s'=>'Xato: %1$s sozlamalarini qo\'llab bo\'lmadi','Restored backup settings %1$s'=>'%1$s zaxira nusxasi sozlamalari tiklandi','Applied the %1$s preset %2$s'=>'%1$s %2$s predseti qo\'llanildi','Backup created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset'=>'%2$s sozlamasini qo\'llashdan %1$s oldin zaxira nusxasi yaratildi','This will restore the backup settings created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset. Any changes made since then will be lost. Do you want to continue?'=>'Bu %1$s oldin %2$s sozlamasini qo‘llash orqali yaratilgan zaxira nusxasi sozlamalarini tiklaydi. Shundan beri kiritilgan har qanday o‘zgarishlar yo‘qoladi. Davom etishni xohlaysizmi?','Restore Settings'=>'Sozlamalarni tiklash','Zinn® Cache Engine View .htaccess'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine .htaccess ko\'rinishi','.htaccess Path'=>'.htaccess yo\'li','Frontend .htaccess Path'=>'Frontend .htaccess yo‘li','Default path is'=>'Standart yo\'lak:','PHP Constant %s is supported.'=>'PHP doimiysi %s qo\'llab-quvvatlanadi.','You can use this code %1$s in %2$s to specify the htaccess file path.'=>'Htaccess fayl yo\'lini ko\'rsatish uchun %2$s da ushbu %1$s kodidan foydalanishingiz mumkin.','Backend .htaccess Path'=>'Backend .htaccess yo\'li','Current %s Contents'=>'Joriy %s tarkibi','View .htaccess'=>'.htaccess faylini koʻrish','Heartbeat'=>'Yurak urishi','Debug Settings'=>'Nasozliklarni tuzatish sozlamalari','Log View'=>'Жurnal ko‘rinishi','Zinn® Cache Engine Toolbox'=>'Zinn® Kesh mexanizmi asboblar to‘plami','Heartbeat Control'=>'Yurak urishini boshqarish','Disable WordPress interval heartbeat to reduce server load.'=>'Server yuklamasini kamaytirish uchun WordPress interval yurak urishini o‘chirish.','Disabling this may cause WordPress tasks triggered by AJAX to stop working.'=>'Buni o\'chirish AJAX tomonidan ishga tushiriladigan WordPress vazifalarining ishlashdan to\'xtashiga olib kelishi mumkin.','Turn ON to control heartbeat on frontend.'=>'Frontend\'da heartbeat\'ni boshqarish uchun YOQING.','Specify the %s heartbeat interval in seconds.'=>'%scha yurak urishi oralig\'ini soniyalarda ko\'rsating.','WordPress valid interval is %s seconds.'=>'WordPress yaroqli intervali %s soniyani tashkil qiladi.','Set to %1$s to forbid heartbeat on %2$s.'=>'%2$s da heartbeat ni taqiqlash uchun %1$s qilib o\'rnating.','Turn ON to control heartbeat on backend.'=>'Backendda heartbeat funksiyasini boshqarish uchun YOQING.','Turn ON to control heartbeat in backend editor.'=>'Backend muharririda yurak urishini (heartbeat) boshqarish uchun YOQING.','Export Settings'=>'Sozlamalarni eksport qilish','Export'=>'Eksport qilish','Last exported'=>'Oxirgi marta eksport qilingan','This will export all current Zinn® Cache Engine settings and save them as a file.'=>'Bu amal barcha joriy Zinn® Cache Engine sozlamalarini eksport qiladi va ularni fayl sifatida saqlaydi.','Import Settings'=>'Sozlamalarni import qilish','Import'=>'Import qilish','Last imported'=>'Oxirgi marta import qilingan','This will import settings from a file and override all current Zinn® Cache Engine settings.'=>'Bu fayldan sozlamalarni import qiladi va barcha joriy Zinn® Cache Engine sozlamalarini bekor qiladi.','Reset All Settings'=>'Barcha sozlamalarni tiklash','This will reset all settings to default settings.'=>'Bu barcha sozlamalarni standart sozlamalarga qaytaradi.','Are you sure you want to reset all settings back to the default settings?'=>'Barcha sozlamalarni standart holatga qaytarishni xohlaysizmi?','Reset Settings'=>'Sozlamalarni tiklash','Purge Log'=>'Jurnalni tozalash','Crawler Log'=>'Qidiruv botlari jurnali','LiteSpeed Logs'=>'LiteSpeed ​​jurnallari','Clear Logs'=>'Jurnallarni tozalash','Click to copy'=>'Nusxa olish uchun bosing','Copy Log'=>'Logdan nusxa olish','Click to download'=>'Yuklab olish uchun bosing','Download'=>'Yuklab olish','Purge Front Page'=>'Bosh sahifani tozalash','This will Purge Front Page only'=>'Bu faqat Bosh sahifani tozalaydi','Purge Pages'=>'Sahifalarni tozalash','This will Purge Pages only'=>'Faqat sahifalarni tozalaydi','Purge %s Error'=>'%s xatosini tozalash','Purge %s error pages'=>'%s xatolik sahifalarini tozalash','Purge the LiteSpeed cache entries created by this plugin'=>'Ushbu plagin tomonidan yaratilgan LiteSpeed kesh yozuvlarini tozalang','This will purge all minified/combined CSS/JS entries only'=>'Bu faqat barcha kichraytirilgan/birlashtirilgan CSS/JS yozuvlarini tozalaydi','Purge all the object caches'=>'Barcha obyekt keshlarini tozalash','Reset the entire opcode cache'=>'Butun opcode keshini qayta o\'rnatish','Critical CSS'=>'Muhim CSS','This will delete all generated critical CSS files'=>'Bu yaratilgan barcha muhim CSS fayllarini o\'chirib yuboradi','Unique CSS'=>'Noyob CSS','This will delete all generated unique CSS files'=>'Bu yaratilgan barcha noyob CSS fayllarini o\'chirib tashlaydi','This will delete all localized resources'=>'Bu barcha mahalliy resurslarni o\'chirib yuboradi','This will delete all generated image LQIP placeholder files'=>'Bu yaratilgan barcha tasvir LQIP to\'ldiruvchi fayllarini o\'chirib yuboradi','This will delete all generated Viewport Images'=>'Bu yaratilgan barcha Viewport tasvirlarini oʻchirib yuboradi','This will delete all cached Gravatar files'=>'Bu barcha keshlangan Gravatar fayllarini o\'chirib tashlaydi','Purge the cache entries created by this plugin except for Critical CSS & Unique CSS & LQIP caches'=>'Kritik CSS, Unikal CSS va LQIP keshlaridan tashqari ushbu plagin tomonidan yaratilgan kesh yozuvlarini tozalash','Empty Entire Cache'=>'Butun keshni tozalash','Clears all cache entries related to this site, including other web applications.'=>'Ushbu saytga, jumladan boshqa veb-ilovalarga tegishli barcha kesh yozuvlarini tozalaydi.','This action should only be used if things are cached incorrectly.'=>'Bu amal faqat kesh noto\'g\'ri saqlangandagina ishlatilishi kerak.','This will clear EVERYTHING inside the cache.'=>'Bu kesh ichidagi BARCHA narsani tozalaydi.','This may cause heavy load on the server.'=>'Bu serverga og\'ir yuk keltirishi mumkin.','If only the WordPress site should be purged, use Purge All.'=>'Agar faqat WordPress saytini tozalash kerak bo\'lsa, Purge All\'dan foydalaning.','Purge By...'=>'Quyidagilar bo\'yicha tozalash...','Select below for "Purge by" options.'=>'"Purge by" opsiyalarini tanlash uchun quyidagini tanlang.','Category'=>'Kategoriya','Post ID'=>'Maqola ID','Tag'=>'Teg','Purge pages by category name - e.g. %2$s should be used for the URL %1$s.'=>'Sahifalarni kategoriya nomi bo\'yicha tozalash - masalan, %1$s URL manzili uchun %2$s ishlatilishi kerak.','Purge pages by post ID.'=>'Post ID bo\'yicha sahifalarni tozalash.','Purge pages by tag name - e.g. %2$s should be used for the URL %1$s.'=>'Sahifalarni teg nomi bo\'yicha tozalash - masalan, %1$s URL manzili uchun %2$s ishlatilishi kerak.','Purge pages by relative or full URL.'=>'Nisbiy yoki to\'liq URL bo\'yicha sahifalarni tozalash.','e.g. Use %1$s or %2$s.'=>'masalan, %1$s yoki %2$s dan foydalaning.','Purge List'=>'Tozalash roʻyxati','Debug Helpers'=>'Tuzatish yordamchilari','View Site Before Optimization'=>'Optimizatsiyadan oldin saytni ko\'rish','View Site Before Cache'=>'Keshdan oldin saytni ko‘rish','Disable All Features for 24 Hours'=>'Barcha funksiyalarni 24 soatga o\'chirish','Remove `Disable All Feature` Flag Now'=>'`Disable All Feature` Bayrog\'ini Hozir Olib Tashlang','Zinn® Cache Engine is temporarily disabled until: %s.'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine vaqtincha o\'chirilgan, muddati: %s.','This will disable LSCache and all optimization features for debug purpose.'=>'Bu disk raskrovka maqsadida LSCache va barcha optimallashtirish funksiyalarini o\'chirib qo\'yadi.','Admin IP Only'=>'Faqat admin IP manzili','Outputs to a series of files in the %s directory.'=>'%s katalogidagi bir qator faylarga chiqaradi.','To prevent filling up the disk, this setting should be OFF when everything is working.'=>'Disk to\'lib qolishining oldini olish uchun hamma narsa to\'g\'ri ishlab turganda bu sozlama O\'CHIQ bo\'lishi kerak.','The Admin IP option will only output log messages on requests from admin IPs listed below.'=>'Admin IP opsiyasi faqat quyida ko‘rsatilgan admin IP-manzillaridan kelgan so‘rovlar bo‘yicha log xabarlarini chiqaradi.','Allows listed IPs (one per line) to perform certain actions from their browsers.'=>'Ko\'rsatilgan IP-larga (har bir qatorda bittadan) o\'z brauzerlaridan muayyan amallarni bajarishga ruxsat beradi.','Your IP'=>'Sizning IP manzilingiz','More information about the available commands can be found here.'=>'Mavjud buyruqlar haqida qo\'shimcha ma\'lumotni bu yerda topishingiz mumkin.','Advanced level will log more details.'=>'Ilg\'or daraja ko\'proq tafsilotlarni yozib oladi.','MB'=>'MB','Specify the maximum size of the log file.'=>'Log faylining maksimal hajmini ko\'rsating.','Shorten query strings in the debug log to improve readability.'=>'O\'qishni osonlashtirish uchun disk raskadrovka jurnalidagi so\'rov satrlarini qisqartiring.','Only log listed pages.'=>'Faqat roʻyxatga olingan sahifalarni jurnalga yozish.','Prevent any debug log of listed pages.'=>'Ko‘rsatilgan sahifalarning har qanday disk raskadrovka jurnalini oldini oling.','Prevent writing log entries that include listed strings.'=>'Ko\'rsatilgan satrlarni o\'z ichiga olgan jurnal yozuvlarini yozishning oldini olish.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Zinn Digital® chiqarilish eslatmalariga qarang.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Yuklab olingan yangilanish yaxlitlik tekshiruvidan o\'tmadi va o\'rnatilmadi.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — qoʻllanmalar va xizmatlar','User guides'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmalari','Read the %s user guide'=>'%s foydalanuvchi qo\'llanmasini o\'qing','Hide this'=>'Buni yashirish','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'WordPress uchun Zinn® xostingi','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kunlik zaxira nusxalari, bepul migratsiya va birdan ortiq saytni boshqaradigan shaxslar uchun mo‘ljallangan boshqaruv paneli.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® bozori','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Tayyor saytlar, domenlar va havola joylashtirishni sotib oling va soting, ikkala tomon ham mamnun bo\'lgunga qadar pul xavfsiz tarzda saqlanadi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — buni kasb qilgan mutaxassislarni yollang','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Bizning global frilanserlar bozori: matn yozuvchilar, dizaynerlar, dasturchilar va SEO mutaxassislarining 10 000 dan ortiq tayyor xizmatlarini ko\'rib chiqing yoki loyiha joylashtirib, ularga taklif kiritish imkonini bering.']];